SUMMARY:Saxophone Day
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260913T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260913T160000
UID:2609020i1t-d7v3U-R9XogSf87tA
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Saxophone Day\, a dynamic celebration of music and
  community\, featuring the talented duo HaLo in a captivating recital prog
 ram that includes the world premiere of Wu's "Glass Terminal" and stunning
  works by Yoshimatsu\, Waksman\, and Nagao. This exciting event also offer
 s masterclasses\, vendor exhibits\, and more\, providing a unique opportun
 ity for saxophonists and music enthusiasts to connect\, learn\, and be ins
 pired. Come experience the energy and artistry of Saxophone Day\, with a s
 chedule that includes masterclasses from 12-2 PM\, vendor exhibits from 2-
 3 PM\, and the duo HaLo's recital from 3-4 PM.
LOCATION:Green Music Center\, Schroeder Hall
URL:https://music.sonoma.edu/events/saxophone-day-0
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
