DESCRIPTION:The Tahoes have traversed the West Coast for over 12 years\, b
 ringing their unique brand of good vibes to hella stoked audiences everywh
 ere.\n\nThe Tahoes’ fun-filled sets are a mix of originals and favorites
  that keep the party going!  We play a mix of rock\, reggae rock\, punk\, 
 and a dash of funk\; made up of former members of The Conspiracy\, Biting 
 The Dog\, No Simple Highway\, and Fallout.\n\nWe have played support to na
 tional headliners:\n\nSublime with Rome\, 311\, The Wailers\, The Aggrolit
 es\, Fishbone\, Fortunate Youth\, The Mad Caddies and Wonderbread 5.\n\nTh
 e Tahoes have performed at: High Times Cannabis Cup\, The Sonoma County Fa
 ir\, Mcnear’s Mystic Theatre\, The Boonville Beer Fest\, Rojo's Tavern i
 n South Lake Tahoe\, The Uptown Oakland\, DNA Lounge\, The Riptide\, Botto
 m of the Hill in SF\, and the Hope Mountain Festival in Oregon among other
 s.\n\nThe Tahoes are:\n\nScott Foreman \\[Lead Vocals & Keys\\]\n\nDarren 
 Thompson \\[Vocals\, Guitar\\]\n\nJoel Gieseker \\[Bass\\]\n\nJoe LaRosa \
 \[Drums\\]
LOCATION:Waterhawk Lake Club
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/108551178?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
