DESCRIPTION:Celebrate summer at Landmark Vineyards with the return of the 
  Sips & Sunshine Music Series . This family-friendly event brings the comm
 unity together for an afternoon of live music\, lawn games\, and beautiful
  vineyard views in the heart of Sonoma Valley. Enjoy Landmark wines and de
 licious fare from local food trucks\, available for purchase throughout th
 e event. Guests of all ages\, including well-behaved pets\, are welcome to
  relax\, play\, and soak up the festive outdoor atmosphere. Whether you're
  gathering with family\, friends\, or fellow wine lovers\, this seasonal t
 radition offers the perfect way to enjoy great music\, local flavors\, and
  the beauty of Sonoma wine country. Advance reservations are recommended\,
  as tickets are subject to availability.
