BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.hookandladderwinery.com/event/no-cell-sundays-p-butta", "Press Democrat": "https://www.hookandladderwinery.com/event/no-cell-sundays-p-butta"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.hookandladderwinery.com/event/no-cell-sundays-p-butta"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:No Cell Sundays: P-Butta
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260913T123000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260913T143000
UID:260902RgC0493v40evwQu76n03sg
DESCRIPTION:**Unplug and Groove: P-Butta Live at the Vineyard**\n\nJoin us
  for No Cell Sundays with P-Butta\, a local powerhouse trio that's been ma
 king Sonoma County move for decades.\n\nP-Butta is the instrumental side p
 roject of the musicians from Rising Tide\, the original Groundation band. 
 With Marcus Urani on keyboards\, Ryan Newman on bass\, and Paul Spina on d
 rums\, this three-piece brings together four decades of funk\, soul\, and 
 jazz mastery that satisfies any musical palate.\n\nExpect to hear groovy c
 overs from legendary artists like The Meters\, Booker T & the M.G.'s\, Her
 bie Hancock\, Donnie Hathaway\, Cannonball Adderley\, and even the Beastie
  Boys. Whether you're a jazz head or just love good vibes\, P-Butta delive
 rs the perfect soundtrack for a Sunday afternoon in wine country.\n\n**Wha
 t's No Cell Sundays?**\n\nIt's simple: disconnect from your devices\, reco
 nnect with great wine\, live music\, and the people around you. *Check yo
 ur phone with us at the door and receive a complimentary tasting.* Bring 
 a blanket\, grab a glass\, and spend your Sunday the way it was meant to b
 e spent.
LOCATION:Hook & Ladder Winery
URL:https://www.hookandladderwinery.com/event/no-cell-sundays-p-butta
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://lynmarestate.com/reservation/type/collectors-lunch-pairing/", "Press Democrat": "https://lynmarestate.com/reservation/type/collectors-lunch-pairing/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://lynmarestate.com/reservation/type/collectors-lunch-pairing/"}
