BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Golocal": "https://golocal.coop/event/carlos-reyes-master-jazz-violinist/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:golocal
X-SOURCE:GoLocal Cooperative
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260913T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260913T200000
DTSTAMP:20260516T130956Z
CREATED:20260516T130956Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260516T130956Z
UID:70952-1789322400-1789329600@golocal.coop
SUMMARY:Carlos Reyes (Master Jazz Violinist)
DESCRIPTION:The Inn at Occidental is proud to welcome back our Sunset Concert Series for 2026. Join us on select Sunday evenings as live music fills the courtyard and the sun sets over West Sonoma County. Our outdoor bar will be pouring local wines\, craft beers\, and seasonal spritzes\, with a rotating lineup of local food offerings available each night. Please join us for great music\, great food and wine\, and relaxed summer evenings in the redwoods. \nSunday\, September 13 from 6pm – 8pm we are proud to present Carlos Reyes (Master Jazz Violinist) \nABOUT Carlos Reyes \n“Santana meets the Gipsy Kings” \nBorn in Paraguay and performing publicly since the age of five\, Carlos Reyes has spent a lifetime redefining what the Paraguayan harp and violin can do. A child prodigy who began studying violin at three\, he soon took up the traditional 36-string Paraguayan harp\, turning an early challenge from his father into a lifelong musical path. \nBy his teens\, Carlos had already debuted with the Oakland Symphony and Oakland Youth Symphony and was working in professional recording studios. He went on to build an international career as a recording artist\, producer\, and multi-instrumentalist. \nHis debut album The Beauty of It All spent more than 15 weeks in Billboard’s Top Ten Contemporary Jazz charts\, launching a career that has taken him across Europe\, Asia\, and the Americas. Along the way he has performed and recorded with artists including Steve Miller\, Willie Nelson\, Chuck Mangione\, and The Doobie Brothers. \nBlending Latin\, jazz\, rock\, and classical influences\, Carlos brings a bold and innovative voice to the harp\, expanding the instrument’s possibilities both acoustically and electronically. Whether performing solo or with a full ensemble\, his performances combine virtuosity\, passion\, and a deeply expressive musical spirit.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/carlos-reyes-master-jazz-violinist/
LOCATION:Inn at Occidental\, 3657 Church St. #857\, Occidental\, CA\, 95465\, United States
CATEGORIES:Music
END:VEVENT
