DESCRIPTION:Hispanic Heritage Month takes place from September 15 to Octob
 er 15. This month's drop in craft is dedicated to the Mexican Folk Art Mir
 ror. Using materials such as foil\, paper plates\, and markers/crayons/col
 or pencils\, we'll be making our own version of the Mexican Folk Art Mirro
 r. This project is a drop in craft that will be available during open libr
 ary hours starting on Monday\, September 14 to Saturday\, September 26. Su
 pplies are limited and will be available on a first come\, first serve bas
 is.
