  Guild will provide all materials -- fabric\, thread\, sewing machines\, n
 eedles\, etc. and their expertise -- for free! IF you have a sewing machin
 e\, we STRONGLY encourage you to bring it to the class \\(with all attachm
 ents\, pedals\, manuals etc.\\) but it is not necessary or required to hav
 e a machine to participate. Signing up for the first class will automatica
 lly sign you up for the ENTIRE SERIES. Questions? Call us at 707-537-0162
