UID:260909pQyJJp5pzUKCtkps1Bk6AA
DESCRIPTION:We offered up—to all the candidates for Vallejo City Council
  District 4—an opportunity to come hang for a night at our Coal Shed Bre
 wery and meet and greet with voters. And they all said yes!\n\n‍First up
 : a moderated forum\, hosted in partnership with the Mare Island Neighborh
 ood Watch. Landis Graden moderates. Ninety minutes\, equal time for every 
 candidate\, and questions prepared in advance covering Mare Island develop
 ment\, Mare Island taxes\, shipyard revitalization\, and how the City of V
 allejo is run.‍\n\nBar opens at 5:30pm · Questions start at 6:00pm\n\nF
 uture dates - Each candidate is posting up at our Coal Shed Brewery for a 
 casual meet and greet with voters. No stage\, no moderator\, just a chance
  to have a conversation \\(and grab a pint\\) with your council candidate!
  Each event starts at 6pm.\n\n‍09/17 – Brianna Rogers\, 10/01 – Chr
 is Platzer\, 10/08 – Charles Palmares\n\n‍We're not endorsing anyone\,
  but we have mad respect for anyone who is willing to step into the arena.
  Let's keep the community and conversation flowing.
LOCATION:Coal Shed Brewery
URL:https://www.mareislandbrewingco.com/events/pints-with-politicians-cand
 idates-forum-vallejo-district-4
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
