DESCRIPTION:VCUSD has shared that preliminary work on the Grant School sit
 e began on September 8\, with air monitoring in place\, and major demoliti
 on is anticipated to begin September 16.\n\nJoin us to hear the latest\, a
 sk questions\, and learn what to expect as demolition\, cleanup\, and reme
 diation move forward. We’ll also share updates on South Vallejo Beautifi
 cation Weekend and Neighborhood Watch. Bring your questions. Bring a neigh
 bor. Stay informed.
