X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Tom Schwedhelm for Supervisor 2026 Community Engagement Series San
 ta Rosa
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260915T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260915T193000
UID:260910GwCJiyaA5EqFL7kJPLHfZg
DESCRIPTION:I hope you will join us for Round 2 of Our Community Engagemen
 t Series\, which kicks off Tuesday\, September 15th from 5:30pm to 7:00pm 
 at the LBC in Larkfield \\(50 Mark West Springs Road\\). Can't make it on 
 9/15? Our Santa Rosa meeting will be the first in a series of 5 meetings i
 n Northern Sonoma County\, with other meetings planned in Windsor\, Geyser
 ville\, Cloverdale and Healdsburg \\(more info on all meetings below\\). A
 ll meetings will run from 5:30pm to 7:00pm and all are free to attend - I 
 hope to see you there! I am proud to be the only candidate for Supervisor 
 hosting a Community Engagement Series\, and welcome the opportunity to con
 nect with you\, your neighbors\, and all North County residents!\n\nTOM SC
 HWEDHELM’S COMMUNITY ENGAGEMENT SERIES\n\nFive Meetings to Choose From:\
 n\n1. SANTA ROSA: Tuesday\, September 15 at the Luther Burbank Center for 
 the Arts \\(50 Mark West Springs Road\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95403\\)\n\n2. WIN
