X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Apa Pool League": "https://www.meetup.com/apa-pool-league/events/316307544/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_apa_pool_league
X-SOURCE:Sonoma County APA Pool League
UID:event_316307544@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260913T043537Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260916T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260916T220000
SUMMARY:APA Pool League Game Night Extravaganza!
DESCRIPTION:Apa Pool League\nJoin us for an exciting evening of pool at th
 e APA Pool League Night Extravaganza! Whether you are a seasoned pro or a 
 beginner\, this event is open to all players looking to have a fun time. G
 et ready to showcase your billiards skills\, learn new strategies\, and me
 et fellow pool enthusiasts. This is the perfect opportunity to socialize\,
  enjoy friendly competition\, and immerse yourself in the thrilling world 
 of pool leagues.\n\nDon't miss out on the chance to be part of the Apa Poo
 l League community as we come together for a night filled with games\, cam
 araderie\, and good times. Whether you're interested in testing your skill
 s\, learning from others\, or simply having a blast\, this event has somet
 hing for everyone. Grab your cue\, chalk up your pool stick\, and get read
 y for an unforgettable gaming experience with APA Pool League!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/apa-pool-league/events/316307544/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260828T021240Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260828T021240Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Apa Pool League": "https://www.meetup.com/apa-pool-league/events/316307719/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_apa_pool_league
X-SOURCE:Sonoma County APA Pool League
UID:event_316307719@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260913T043537Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260916T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260916T220000
SUMMARY:APA Pool League - New Session Starting
DESCRIPTION:Apa Pool League\nJoin us for a thrilling APA Pool League Game 
 Night where we come together to showcase our skills in billiards and pool.
  Whether you're a seasoned player or a beginner looking to learn the ropes
 \, this event is perfect for pool enthusiasts of all levels. Test your str
 ategy\, improve your game\, and enjoy a friendly competition with fellow m
 embers of the APA Pool League. If you are looking for a fun night out to h
 ave fun\, meet people\, and play pool. Sonoma County APA is perfect for yo
 u. You don't have to be a pool shark to join. Beginners wanted. We are the
  worlds largest pool league and a fun league that competes once a week. Te
 ams that win\, will receive a fully paid trip to Las Vegas to compete in t
 he World Pool Championships. You can either join an existing team or creat
 e your own. Creating a team is very easy. You can grab 2 friends and have 
 them bring 2 of their friends. Friends\, co-workers\, or family. Everyone 
 can play and anyone can win. 5-8 players on a team. If you cant create a t
 eam\, come join an existing team. We have divisions that play on Tuesday\,
  Wednesday\, or Thursday nights. If you need more information\, please rea
 ch out to me. 707-687-8757 (Max)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/apa-pool-league/events/316307719/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260828T021551Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260828T021551Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Sonoma County Womens Wine Club": "https://www.meetup.com/sonoma-county-womens-wine-club/events/315202012/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_sonoma_county_womens_wine_club
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Women's Wine Club
UID:event_315202012@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260913T043529Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260916T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260916T210000
SUMMARY:Give 'Em the Arrow Again!  Ladies Night at the Archery Range
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma County Women's Wine Club (SCWWC)\nI'm super excited to 
 be able to offer another ladies' Archery night in Santa Rosa! If you've ev
 er had a curiosity about archery\, this is your chance to find out more wi
 th a fun\, interactive lesson.\n\nWe have reserved a special event with th
 e indoor range on a Wednesday evening. It will consist of a basic lesson\,
  and then we all get to practice shooting. Everyone will get ample time to
  practice\, as they have many lanes.\n\nThis event is focused on a less-co
 mpetitive\, relaxed\, and entertaining atmosphere. All skill levels are en
 couraged.\n\nAll equipment is provided by them\, and we will probably get 
 about an hour or hour and a half to practice.\n\nI encourage everyone to b
 ring a bottle of wine or a snack to share with the rest of the group (We u
 sually end up with a lovely charcuterie and wine spread for everyone to en
 joy). Closed toe shoes recommended.\n\nThere are 17 spots available\, gues
 ts welcome. The ladies' group lesson and event is $31 per person\, with $6
  prepaid via Paypal and $25 paid to the range.\n\nPlease only RSVP 'Yes' i
 f you are able to make it\, hostess Dai Phipps will be collecting a $6 fee
  via Paypal to hold your spot. Paypal/Meetup should lead you to make your 
 payment after you RSVP 'Yes'.\n\nThere is an attendance policy for all our
  events: if you No-Show to three events\, you may not attend events for th
 e next three months. Please put this event in your calendar so you don't m
 iss out or get dinged. A No-Show is when you are on the 'Going' list\, but
  do not show up.\n\nCheers\, and hope to see you there!\n\nJoleen
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/sonoma-county-womens-wine-club/events
 /315202012/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260610T185300Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260610T185300Z
