DESCRIPTION:This event is limited to SoCo DSA Chapter members.\nColab with 
 comrades is a working meeting space where DSA members are empowered and enc
 ouraged to work on DSA projects with each other. As a member\, would you li
 ke to jump in and start working on things that keep our org running? Would 
 you like to learn how projects get started and help DSA grow? This is the s
 pace for you! \nFood\, drink\, wifi\, and fuzzy cats will be provided.  Ple
 ase consider brining something to help take notes or do research on the int
 ernet with\, but by no means is required.\nSeats are limited. Please RSVP a
 s we have a limit of 14 people can attend. \nI plan to make colab a continu
 al meeting each month\; as when we work while we meet\, we get a lot done a
 nd we grow closer too.\nHope to see you there!\n\nRSVP: https://solidarity.
 socodsa.org/colab-with-comrades-2
