X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.marincounty.org/main/calendar#/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Marin County Library presents "Mood of America" Docu mentary Scree
 ning and Panel Discussion
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260917T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260917T210000
UID:260819vVYlk3emv02ghifyNepCpA
DESCRIPTION:Venue Name: Showcase Theater Venue Address: 10 Ave of the Flag
 sSan Rafael\, CA 94903-5204 Venue Phone: Marin Center \\(415\\)499-6400 Bo
 x Office \\(415\\)499-6800 Seating Chart:  Showcase Theater Seating Chart 
 Venue Details: It seats 315 in upholstered comfort\, has a 40-foot proscen
 ium\, and is fully equipped with theatrical lig hting\, dimming and studio
  quality sound system. There is also a light and sound control booth with 
 provisions for slide and 16mm film projection. When the Showcase Theatre i
 sn't being a theatre\, it's a meeting room. Many Marin businesses and orga
 nizations schedule meetings and conferences at the Showcase. In either cas
 e\, no seat is more than 45 feet from the stage. Venue Info:  Rental Infor
 mation Price: Free Ticket Info: N/A\n\nIn partnership with the League of W
 omen Voters and Performing Stars of Marin\, Marin County Free Library will
  host a free screening of the 1968 BBC documentary\, "The Mood of America\
 ," which captured th e aftermath of a voluntary desegregation plan that oc
 curred in 1965 within the Sausalito Marin City School District. In the fil
 m\, the investigators examine perspectives on what was happening in the sc
 hool district by interviewing students\, parents\, school board members\, 
 and Principal Sidney Walton.
LOCATION:Showcase Theatre
URL:https://www.marincounty.org/main/calendar#/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Indivisible Sonoma County (Mobilize)": "https://www.mobilize.us/ft6/event/405150/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:mobilize_indivisible_sonoma
SUMMARY:Text on Tap Free Texting - Register Democrats in Swing States!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260917T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260917T163000
UID:190fc0b6a161d590aef60b11ec18251b@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/TOT_Bootcamp_FB_20260504032354190280.png
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to the biggest fight of our lives. Time to join Field 
 Team 6's free Text on Tap text team - and text millions of unregistered li
 kely Democrats in key swing states to win key elections in 2026! We love f
 ree texting! We call it Text on Tap\, and it's the new and improved versio
