DESCRIPTION:WigOut Sonoma! 2026\n\nDate: Thursday\, September 17\, 2026\n
 \nTime: 5:00 p.m. – 9:00 p.m.\n\nLocation: Jacuzzi Family Vineyards 24
 724 Arnold Drive Sonoma\, CA 95476\n\nTickets: $200 per person\n\nPurchas
 e Tickets: cancersupportsonoma.org/wigout\n\nWigOut Sonoma! is Cancer Sup
 port Sonoma's signature annual fundraiser. Guests are invited to wear a fa
 vorite wig \\(optional!\\) and enjoy an unforgettable evening featuring go
 urmet cuisine\, exceptional wines\, live music\, and exciting silent and l
 ive auctions. Proceeds support Cancer Support Sonoma's mission of providin
 g integrative therapies and compassionate care to local individuals and fa
 milies facing cancer\, regardless of their ability to pay.\n\nWe hope you'
 ll join us for an evening of fun\, generosity\, and community as we help e
 nsure that no one in Sonoma Valley faces cancer alone.
