X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Art Night at Great Company
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260917T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260917T183000
UID:260912PP19ZmafcUGFuIG4xiFyhA
DESCRIPTION:Join Great Company on Thursday\, September 17th for Art Night
  at 5:30pm. Art night is a free\, non-ticketed event\, with suggested don
 ations for supplies.\n\nArt Night is a monthly gathering focused on commu
 nity\, creativity\, and connection.\n\nMonthly Creative Gathering: A play
 ful\, low-pressure space to create alongside friends and community.\n\nPro
 ject: We feature 1 new guided art project each month with a short intro a
 nd demo to get you started. We always have a library of art supplies avail
 able if you’re not feeling the guided project.\n\nFlexible Supplies: Us
 e the materials we provide for a $5–$10 donation\\*\, or bring your own
  project to work on for free. \\(\\*This is all self-funded\, so we appre
 ciate any help.\\)\n\nAll Skill Levels: No experience needed! Our roaming
  hosts are there to offer ideas\, tips\, and encouragement—it’s about 
 the process\, not perfection.
LOCATION:Great Company
URL:https://montgomeryvillageca.com/event/art-night-at-great-company/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat, Visit Santa Rosa
END:VEVENT
