SUMMARY:The Boathouse Wine & Food Pairing Experience – Cuvaison and Bran
 dlin Estate
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260918T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260918T170000
UID:260806lxleHFOdskKrS7-RP34zUg
DESCRIPTION:The Boathouse Wine & Food Pairing Experience invites you on an
  elevated wine journey set in Cuvaison’s stunning waterfront boathouses.
  This luxurious wine tasting experience offers scenic views and a tranquil
  atmosphere\, nestled over the serene reservoir amidst wraparound vineyard
 s. Enjoy a tasting of expertly selected wines paired with seasonal small b
 ites for a curated tasting and pairing.\n\nThe Brandlin Estate Boathouse W
 ine & Food Pairing Experience features 6 wines. The Cuvaison Boathouse Win
 e & Food Pairing Experience features 5 wines.\n\nSet on the edge of the tr
 anquil estate reservoir and surrounded by vineyard views\, the Boathouses 
 offer a peaceful\, private setting for your tasting. Each 120-minute exper
 ience includes a guided flight of estate-grown wines from Cuvaison and Bra
 ndlin Estate\, two estates rooted in Napa Valley history. Together\, they 
 showcase our winemaking philosophy\, from the cool-climate elegance of Los
  Carneros to the bold character of mountain-grown reds from Mt. Veeder.\n\
 n**Brandin Estate Menu for July 1st – September 30th**\n\n**Peaches n Cr
 eam**\n\ncharred peaches | whipped savory lemon cream | toasted nut crumbl
 e\n\n2024 Brandlin Estate Sauvignon Blanc \n\n**Mushroom Quiche Tartlet**
 \n\npaprika crema | chives\n\n2022 Brandlin Estate Henry’s Keep\, Red Wi
 ne\n\n**Moroccan Chicken Skewer**\n\nred bell pepper sauce | evoo | sunflo
 wer see crumble\n\n2022 Brandlin Estate Malbec\n\n**Roasted Duck Rillette*
 *\n\ncooked cherries\, red onion & zucchini relish | artisan cracker\n\n20
 22 Brandlin Estate Old Vine Zinfandel\n\n**Herbed Beef Meatballs**\n\nsmok
 ed eggplant puree | shaved parmesan\n\n2023 Brandlin Estate Cabernet Sauvi
 gnon\n\n2019 Brandlin Estate Cabernet Sauvignon\n\nBrandlin Estate Boathou
 se Wine & Food Pairing Experience: $195/person\n\n**Cuvaison Menu** **for 
 July 1st – September 30th**\n\n**Feta Mousse | Roasted Corn | Charred Ap
 ricot | Radish**\n\ntoasted brioche bread\n\n2023 Cuvaison ATS Chardonnay\
 n\n**Herbed Beef Meatloaf**\n\ntomato jam | sautéed capers & cocktail oni
 ons\n\n2023 Cuvaison Adda Pinot Noir\n\n**Mushroom Quiche Tartlet**\n\npap
 rika crema | chives\n\n2023 Cuvaison Arcilla Merlot\n\n**Moroccan Chicken 
 Skewer**\n\nred bell pepper sauce | evoo | sunflower seed crumble\n\n2022 
 Brandlin Estate Henry’s Keep\, Red Wine\n\n2023 Cuvaison Diablo Syrah\n\
 nCuvaison Boathouse Wine & Food Pairing Experience: $180/person
LOCATION:Cuvaison
URL:https://tewines.com/pages/experiences/boathouse-wine-food-pairing-expe
 rience
