 a fun\, friendly & helpful Senior Resource Fair! 💙\n\n✨ Explore to
 ns of helpful resources 🤝 Connect with local organizations & community 
 partners ☕ Enjoy coffee 🍧 Cool off with snow cones 💬 Get connecte
 d with resources that can make a difference!\n\nWhether you're looking for
  information\, support\, services\, or simply want to connect with your co
