SUMMARY:Vallejo punk show!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260918T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260918T183000
UID:260910dGm3N8jeOkm9WlN-WXqSuA
DESCRIPTION:HEMMED UP is a punk rock band hailing from the mean streets of
  the Bay Area in Northern California\,. It takes a lot to cut through the 
 white noise in an area that is so culturally and musically prolific\, and 
 hemmed up achieves just that with songs about life on a road less traveled
 \, dealing with self inflicted wounds\, and commiserating about good times
  and bad. All of this\, backed by a charged blend of outlaw music\, ska\, 
 and punk\, sets the stage for rowdy crowd participation and a truly memora
 ble show! Only bonafide punks should be able to play punk rock\, and only 
 bonafide outlaws should be able to play outlaw music\, and HEMMED UP check
 s all the boxes! Whiskey fueled and gritty lyrics backed by insane bass li
 nes\, shit hot guitar licks\, and drum beats that would make Animal from t
 he muppet’s head spin! This all lends perfectly to the anthemic\, anti-a
 uthoritarian\, Robin Hood mentality that their music has to offer…. Ther
 e are 1312 reasons to love Hemmed Up! New full length album is available d
 igitally 6/25/24.\n\nHemmed up has played many headline shows\, and has sh
 ared the stage with an ever growing list of touring and regional bands lik
 e Get Dead\, Jen Pop \\(from the bombpops\\)\, Hunting Lions\, Surprise Pr
 ivilege\, Öil!\, Fox Medicine\, The Quitters\, and many more!
LOCATION:Carnatitos Customs
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/108749607?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
