DESCRIPTION:Step into a summer evening at the Castello\, where time slows 
 down and the spirit of old-world tradition comes alive. -Enjoy classic Ita
 lian dishes served from roaming food stations -Savor award-winning wines\,
  premium and reserve -Take part in our grape stomping photo op station\, a
  nod to centuries-old winemaking practices – a moment worth capturing -D
 ance as live music fills the air and the sun sets over the estate -The per
 fect atmosphere to enjoy the richness of life the way it was meant to be s
 avored. Friday\, September 18\, 2026 7:00pm – 10:00pm
LOCATION:Castello Diamorosa
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1305950484914932/
