 use the code earlybird11 at checkout. Offer ends September 13th.\n\nPro
 mo Codes are not applicable at the door.\n\nCodes are not case sensitiv
 e\, but must be typed as one word.\n\nStylistically unique and captivating
 \, Ellie James mixes lush indie-pop sounds with the style and edge of he
 r rock 'n' roll background. Her music is both genuine and dance-inducing\,
