 tories all her own. With nearly sold-out headlining shows at Hopmonk\, Ell
 ie shows no signs of stopping with a year ahead full of new shows and new 
 music.\n\nhttps://www.thisiselliejames.com https://www.instagram.com/this
 iselliejames/\n\nFrom Vega is a Sonoma County melodic/progressive rock ba
 nd writing original\, high-energy music with depth\, groove\, and a distin
 ct artistic edge. https://www.instagram.com/fromvegaband/ https://youtu.be
 /WeD-DbJKbC4
