DESCRIPTION:Saturday Harvest Markets are back! 2026 Harvest Markets reopen
  March 21 and continue until December. Harvest Markets take place every Sa
 turday\, 9:00 am-1:00 pm.  The Harvest Market is a great place to pick up 
 organic produce\, fresh flowers\, and vegetable starts from our 6.1 acre s
 ustainable garden! We also sell locally sourced olive oil\, honey\, and fa
 rm fresh eggs from our Sonoma neighbors.  The market accepts credit cards 
 and Apple Pay. Remember to bring your reusable shopping bag! Photo by Mela
 nia Mahoney
