BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://goldridgeorganicfarms.ticketspice.com/heirloom-apple-festival", "Press Democrat": "https://goldridgeorganicfarms.ticketspice.com/heirloom-apple-festival", "Sebastopol Calendar": "https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/heirloom-apple-festival-at-gold-ridge-organic-farms/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://goldridgeorganicfarms.ticketspice.com/heirloom-apple-festival"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Heirloom Apple Festival at Gold Ridge Organic Farms
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260919T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260919T150000
UID:260911YYnEi2AfbU2nPXPojkZJsQ
DESCRIPTION:Experience the magic and heritage of heirloom apples at Gold R
 idge Organic Farms' Fifth Annual Heirloom Apple Festival in Sebastopol. Th
 is family-friendly day honors the wonderful\, diverse\, and delicious heir
 loom apple varieties grown in our organic orchards\, as well as the region
 's rich agricultural history.\n\nFeaturing curated tastes of a handful of 
 our 70+ heirloom apple varieties grown onsite in our organic orchards and 
 our organic Extra Virgin Olive Oils. Plus\, enjoy local cheese and apple p
 airings\, our award-winning apple cider balsamic vinegar and beloved apple
  cider syrup.\n\nStroll through our beautiful olive and apple orchards wit
 h founder-farmer Brooke Hazen or take a ride on our apple-themed trolley. 
 Enjoy a sample of our own freshly pressed apple juice from our hand-turned
  cider press. Spark your curiosity with culinary adventures\, cooking demo
 s\, and displays. Kids can win a prize on an apple-themed scavenger hunt. 
 Plus\, Goatlandia will be here with some special friends to say hello!\n\n
 Local Producers & Friends:\n\nMeet the makers: this year we're celebrating
  local producers who share our passion for honest\, heritage food. Join us
  in welcoming Kiss the Flower Honey Co\, KM Mushrooms\, Blooming Fields Fa
 rm\, and our friend and neighbor\, Larry the Tomato Guy. Each will be samp
 ling their products and sharing more about their farms. \n\nFood & Refres
 hments:\n\nWood-fired pizzas by Chef Seamus (11:00 AM–2:30 PM or until s
 old out)—order in advance or a la carte. Also available: locally made ap
 ple crumble (made with our own apples\, of course) and delicious apple cid
 er slushies.\n\nEntertainment:\n\nLive music by Spike Sikes and his Awesom
 e Hotcakes!\n\nAll activities take place outside\, around our olive press 
 or on the crush pad.
LOCATION:Gold Ridge Organic Farms
URL:https://goldridgeorganicfarms.ticketspice.com/heirloom-apple-festival
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat, Sebastopol Calendar
END:VEVENT
