UID:260910hEcORw_QVEeLWrvpmL6MOA
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the grand finale of the Sonoma Plein Air Festival at
  this outdoor art show and sale on the historic Sonoma Plaza. Featuring wo
 rks by approximately 27 nationally recognized plein air artists\, the even
 t offers visitors the opportunity to view and purchase original paintings 
 while supporting arts education for Sonoma Valley youth. Enjoy a live arti
 st demonstration\, music\, and free hands-on art activities for all ages t
 hroughout the day. Proceeds from artwork sales help fund K-12 art educatio
 n grants\, making every purchase a meaningful investment in the local comm
 unity. This family-friendly event brings together art\, creativity\, and c
 ommunity in one of Sonoma's most beautiful outdoor settings.
LOCATION:Sonoma Plaza
