BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.my805tix.com/e/sbcfarmday-26/tickets", "Press Democrat": "https://www.my805tix.com/e/sbcfarmday-26/tickets"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.my805tix.com/e/sbcfarmday-26/tickets"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:8th Annual Santa Barbara County Farm Day Presented by SEEAG
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260919T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260919T150000
UID:260831mJo6bZY12EKhrRcTF7Yrlw
DESCRIPTION:What is Farm Day?Farm Day is a multiple-location one-day celeb
 ration of the hands and lands that feed us presented by SEEAG\, a 501c3 no
 nprofit organization that educates students and the greater community abou
 t the farm origins of their food. Farm Day is one of SEEAG's four unique e
 ducation programs\, offered 100% FREE for all community members. Farm Day 
 is a self-guided tour experience. Registrants are encouraged to explore nu
 merous participating locations at their leisure. Whether you spend your da
 y at one location or traveling across the county\, this flexible day of fu
 n allows you to personalize your experience to what interests you. Farm Da
 y offers behind-the-scenes tours\, trailer rides\, tastings\, giveaways\, 
 and kid-friendly activities.   Why register?Pre-registration will make che
 cking in at each location fast and easy. Register once and receive QR acce
 ss to all locations\, this means no long lines. Registration includes impo
 rtant updates about Farm Day leading up to the event! See below for a spec
 ial pre-registration giveaway.  Farm Day Trail Map - Plan your Itinerary  
 \\> Farm Day is a self-guided experience. SEEAG has created a Farm Day Tra
 il Map that will provide you with the information you need to plan your it
 inerary for the day. You will find all of the farm day locations\, their a
 ddressews\, and what to expect on the trail map. Attendees typically find 
 the most success when aiming to see 3-4 farms during the day. Each locatio
 n provides a different experience\, ranging from tastings\, tours\, lesson
 s\, kid activities\, or a combination of all. There truly is something for
  everyone!   Farm Day Merch  \\> Discounted merchandise is available to pu
 rchase through the linked merch store. For 2026\, local artist Claudia Par
 do created a beautiful illustration celebrating Santa Barbara County agric
 ulture\, which will be featured on shirts\, prints\, stickers\, and other 
 items. Farm Day merchandise will also be available for purchase from 10:00
  a.m. to 3:00 p.m. on Saturday\, September 19 at four Farm Day locations: 
 Bonipak Produce\, Engel & Gray\, Mark Richardson CTE Center and Agricultur
 al Farm \\(SEEAG's Farm Day Hub\\)\, and Santa Rita Hills Lavender Farm.  
 PRE-REGISTRATION Farm Day Giveaway Contest Details Thank you for pre-regis
 tering to attend Santa Barbara County Farm Day! Complete two easy steps an
 d you'll be automatically entered to win. Two easy steps to win: Pre-regis
 ter for Farm Day \\(contest pre-registration closes Thursday\, September 1
 7\, 2026 at 11:59 PM\\) Attend Farm Day to collect your prize! The Prizes:
  Three winners will receive a $100 gift card and five winners will receive
  one item of Farm Day merchandise of their choice \\(shirt\, hat\, or prin
 t\\) to be picked up at the Mark Richardson CTE Center and Ag Farm on Farm
  Day\, Saturday\, September 19\, 2026. Details: Winners will be notified b
 y email on Friday\, September 18 to arrange prize pickup on Farm Day\, Sat
 urday\, September 19. If a winner is unable to pick up their prize on Farm
  Day\, they must respond by email to arrange an alternate pickup within on
 e week or the prize will be forfeited. All winners must attend Farm Day to
  be eligible to receive their prize. Attendance will be verified through F
 arm Day check-in records. Official Terms: No purchase necessary. Open to i
 ndividuals of all ages\; however\, participants under 18 must have a paren
 t or legal guardian accept the prize on their behalf. Winners will be sele
 cted at random and notified via email. Winners must attend Farm Day to be 
 eligible to claim their prize. Winners may claim their prize on Farm Day o
 r\, if an alternate pickup is arranged by responding to the winner notific
 ation email by 3:00 PM on Farm Day\, at a SEEAG office in Ventura or Santa
  Barbara the following week. SEEAG will verify attendance using Farm Day c
 heck-in records. If a winner does not claim the prize on Farm Day and does
  not respond via email by 3:00 PM on Farm Day to arrange an alternate pick
 up\, the prize will be forfeited and an alternate winner will be selected.
  By entering\, you agree to receive contest-related communications from SE
 EAG. SEEAG reserves the right to modify\, suspend\, or cancel the giveaway
  if circumstances require. \\*\\*\\*Important Registration Information\\*\
 \*\\* The September 17 pre-registration deadline applies only to the conte
 st giveaway. You may continue to pre-register for Farm Day through 10:00 A
 M on Saturday\, September 19. Pre-registration is strongly encouraged\, bu
 t not required. If you're unable to pre-register\, don't worry—you can s
 till join the fun! Look for check-in booths and red signs at every Farm Da
 y location to register when you arrive and get easy access to all Farm Day
  experiences.
URL:https://www.my805tix.com/e/sbcfarmday-26/tickets
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
