SUMMARY:Jack London Park Partners Gala: Jack's 150th - A Bold Wish
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260919T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260919T210000
UID:260422Z8FIX5zer0u9DET7_6BjHA
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Jack London’s 150th birthday with an evening inspi
 red by his bold spirit\, big ideas\, and enduring love of this land. Join 
 friends for a jubilant night of food\, wine\, music\, and joy at the Park 
 where legacy meets celebration and the story continues to unfold. We’ll 
 toast to Jack’s extraordinary life\, reflect on the dream he left behind
 \, and dance into what comes next.\n\nIt’s a birthday. It’s a mileston
 e. It’s a bold wish.\n\nWhen: Saturday\, September 19\, 2026 from 5:00-
 9:00\n\nWhere: Jack London State Historic Park – Eucalyptus Grove and Wi
 nery Ruins\n\nWhat to expect: Delicious appetizers and dinner catered by 
 Park Avenue\, amazing wine from Lasseter Family Winery\, beautiful views\,
  live music\, and a great time!\n\nAll proceeds benefit Jack London Park P
 artners\, a 501\\(c\\)3 non-profit organization.
LOCATION:Jack London State Historic Park
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/jack-london-park-partne
 rs-gala-jack-s-150th-a-bold-wish/18686722/2026-09-19T17
