UID:260910OUpeX0t6m0OoLE-Yz4PUxg
DESCRIPTION:Vietnamese Martyrs Catholic Church Announces The Annual Mid-Au
 tumn Moon Festival - Santa Rosa\, CA. Vietnamese Martyrs Catholic Church i
 s thrilled to announce its upcoming Moon Festival\, a vibrant community ce
 lebration bringing neighbors together for cultural heritage\, family activ
 ities\, and seasonal festivities.\n\nThe event will take place on Saturda
 y of 2nd week\, 09/19/2026 from 6:30PM to 10:00PM at Vietnamese Martyrs
  Catholic Church\, 2652 Stony Point Rd. Santa Rosa\, CA 95407. Admission t
 o the festival is FREE\, and all members of the public are warmly invited
  to attend.\n\nRooted in ancient harvest traditions\, the Moon Festival ho
 nors community\, gratitude\, and togetherness. Attendees can look forward 
 to an exciting lineup of events\, including:\n\nVietnamese food\n\nCultura
 l Music and Dance Show\n\nLanterns for kids\n\n"This festival is a wonderf
 ul opportunity for our community to gather\, celebrate our shared heritage
 \, and welcome neighbors of all backgrounds\," said Phuong Vu\, Event Co
 ordinator. "We look forward to an unforgettable evening of joy\, culture\,
  and connection."\n\nLocal residents\, families\, and media representative
 s are encouraged to join. For more information about the schedule\, parkin
 g\, or volunteer opportunities\, please visit https://www.facebook.com/65
 6931121/posts/pfbid0mihThK1QFPP7bUiEnmC7AXF5LVFURWWyqgz6g6yvQv7N8RHBToonPY
 9g2yX1XLFml/?fs=e&mibextid=wwXIfr&fs=e or contact Phuong Vu at 70736485
 43 or vietcatholicsantarosa@gmail.com.\n\nMedia Contact:\n\nName: Phuong
  Vu\n\nTitle: Event Coordinator\n\nOrganization: Vietnamese Community\n\
 nPhone: 7073648543\n\nEmail: vietcatholicsantarosa@gmail.com\n\nWebsite:
 https://www.facebook.com/656931121/posts/pfbid0mihThK1QFPP7bUiEnmC7AXF5LVF
 URWWyqgz6g6yvQv7N8RHBToonPY9g2yX1XLFml/?fs=e&mibextid=wwXIfr&fs=e
LOCATION:Vietnamese Food Festival
URL:https://www.facebook.com/656931121/posts/pfbid0mihThK1QFPP7bUiEnmC7AXF
 5LVFURWWyqgz6g6yvQv7N8RHBToonPY9g2yX1XLFml/?fs=e&mibextid=wwXIfr&fs=e
