DESCRIPTION:When the parade winds down\, the party turns up.\n\nJoin us fo
 r Pride After Dark\, Russian River Pride's official late-night dance part
 y at the historic River Theater. Event co-produced by local legends Gary a
 nd Serena.\n\nCelebrate with friends old and new as DJs keep the dance flo
 or moving all night long. Expect high-energy music\, colorful lights\, gre
 at drinks\, and the joyful\, welcoming spirit that makes Pride in Guernevi
 lle unlike anywhere else.\n\nWhether you've spent the day at the parade an
 d festival or you're joining us just for the evening\, this is where the c
 elebration continues.\n\nGeneral Admission – $25\n\nEntry to Pride After
  Dark\n\nDancing until 2:00 AM\n\nFull bar available for purchase\n\nVIP 
 – $50\n\nEverything included with General Admission\, plus:\n\nOne compl
 imentary drink ticket\n\nAccess to the exclusive VIP bar\n\nCome dressed t
 o celebrate. Glitter\, sequins\, leather\, denim\, boots\, heels—however
  you express yourself\, you're welcome here.
LOCATION:River Theater
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/pride-after-dark-tickets-1997270978261?af
 f=oddtdtcreator
