SUMMARY:Italian Brunch in the Grove: Harvest Celebration
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260920T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260920T130000
UID:260806cBeyvH9xlE6nRQcfDMBaPw
DESCRIPTION:Raise a glass to the hard work in the vineyards\, the magic of
  the fermentation room\, and the simple pleasures of food\, wine\, and fri
 endship.\n\n**Dates:** Sunday\, September 20\n\n**Time:** 11:00 AM – 1:
 00 PM\n\n**The Morning Toast:** Your experience begins with a crisp\, ref
 reshing Vermentino Spritz—a bright\, effervescent tribute to the morning
  sun and the perfect palate cleanser to kick off this harvest celebration.
 \n\n**The Gathering:** As the scent of the 2026 crush drifts through the 
 air\, we’ll gather around long\, communal tables nestled among our histo
 ric redwood in the Grove. This isn’t just a meal\; it’s a front-row se
 at to the most exciting time of year at the estate. We invite you to share
  in a multi-course\, rustic-elegant brunch crafted by Diavola to honor our
  Italian roots and the incredible bounty of this year’s vintage.\n\n**Th
 e Menu by Diavola**: Inspired by the flavors of the Sonoma autumn\, meticu
 lously designed to illuminate our Italian Heritage Series wines.\n\n**Atmo
 sphere:** Nestled under the cooling shade of a century-old redwood grove\
 , the setting is intimate and grounded. Expect dappled sunlight\, communal
  farmhouse tables\, and the soft sound of Italian-inspired music drifting 
 through the space. The atmosphere is a curated blend of Sonoma County’
 s natural beauty and the warm\, unhurried spirit of a Italian family gat
 hering.\n\n**Attire:** Dress as you would for an outdoor autumn gathering-
  layers are your best friend.
LOCATION:Seghesio Family Vineyards
URL:https://www.seghesio.com/events/italian-harvest-brunch/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
