SUMMARY:A Taste of Harvest Celebration
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260920T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260920T150000
UID:260822M_qNRSR31k6-GVhEdeApNw
DESCRIPTION:Join us in our Fountain Courtyard for a festive harvest lunch 
 celebrating the flavors\, traditions and spirit of the season. Indulge in 
 oak-wood smoked whole organic pig\, fresh tortillas and Epi breads\, heirl
 oom beans\, vibrant salsas\, heirloom tomatoes with burrata\, and a refres
 hing watermelon\, arugula and feta salad. Enjoy the afternoon with our win
 es\, live music and a special behind-the-scenes conversation with a member
  of our winemaking team\, who will share the craft and traditions behind o
 ur harvest season. Good food. Great wine. The magic of harvest.
