SUMMARY:3rd Annual Long Snake Classic Car Show & Two-Lane Blacktop Film Sc
 reening
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260920T123000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260920T150000
UID:260822ZkPROWuxeUO2LruaaIYZhA
DESCRIPTION:BRING OUT YOUR SPARKLING CLASSICS\, YOUR JOYFUL JALOPIES & YOU
 R BELOVED BEATERS \\(or just yourselves!\\) & JOIN THE FUN.\n\nLong Snake 
 Monte Rio is proud to present our 3rd Annual matinee \\+ day of community 
 fun on Sunday\, September 20th\, 2026 at the iconic Monte Rio Theater & Ex
 travaganza\, in Monte Rio\, California.  Car Show at 12:30pm.  Awards & 
 Film Screening at 2pm. \n\n Special guests from the Redwood Empire Chevy
  Club\, Corvettes of Sonoma County & Redwood Empire Region of the Antique 
 Automobile Club will grace the lawn of the iconic 7-year-old Quonset Hut-t
 urned movie theater in a dazzling spectacle of automotive design.  The co
 mmunity is welcomed to arrive an hour and a half before screening time to 
 ogle the classic cars and cast a vote for their favorite car \\(in exchang
 e for Kitty Joe’s key lime pie\\).  Prizes for the top 3 favorite cars 
 have been generously donated by Wonderland Pizzeria \\(Monte Rio\\)\, The 
 Siren’s Cellar \\(Jenner\\) & Cochineal \\(Freestone\\)\n\nChef Dave Mau
  will be serving up his ever-popular Tri-Tip Sandwiches \\(vegetarian alt 
 available\\)\, for lunch.\n\n\\*\\*If you would like to enter your classic
  in the car show\, please email longsnakemonterio@gmail.com
LOCATION:Monte Rio Theater & Extravaganza
URL:https://www.monteriotheater.com/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
