SUMMARY:Sonoma Sundays on the Plaza - Robert Dehlinger’s Alpha Rhythm Ki
 ngs
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260920T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260920T170000
UID:260531_R_MyzM4Ok6rA4VGkIKTUQ
DESCRIPTION:This summer\, Music in Place and the City of Sonoma invite you
  to soak up the sunshine\, sip local wine\, and dance to live music at the
  Sonoma Plaza Grinstead Amphitheater during Sonoma Sundays On the Plaza\, 
 a free concert series running June 7 through October 4\, 2026.\n\nThis wee
 k's lineup features Robert Dehlinger’s Alpha Rhythm Kings! Established i
 n 2017\, the Alpha Rhythm Kings have created quite a stir with music fans\
 , crafting an exciting “King Size California sound” that No Depression
  magazine calls “the badge of authenticity.”\n\nThe “swaggering” (
 Washington Post) ensemble\, led by Rob Dehlinger’s “exhilarating” tr
 umpet and “magnetic” vocals (Jazz Corner)\, has become a favorite with
  audiences all over the globe\, from Idaho to Indiana\, and Beverly Hills 
 to Budapest.\n\nIn 2025\, Rob Dehlinger and the Alpha Rhythm Kings were in
 vited to Osaka\, Japan\, to represent the United States as performers at t
 he World Expo.\n\nSonoma Sundays are free and open to all\, thanks to the 
 generous support of the Sonoma Community Center\, The Dawn Redwoods Trust\
 , and the McNeely Family Foundation.\n\nPack your picnic\, bring your danc
 ing shoes\, and meet us on the Plaza!
LOCATION:Grinstead Amphitheater
URL:https://musicinplace.org/event/sonoma-sundays-on-the-plaza-9-27/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
