X-SOURCE:Riley Street Art Supply
UID:TKF/640bd014795edf4fa3769b14/574/29832180/0/0
DTSTART:20260920T190000Z
DTEND:20260920T210000Z
URL:https://tockify.com/rileystreet.art.com/detail/574/1789930800000
SUMMARY: DEMONSTRATION: PAINTING AN OIL PORTRAIT IN LAYERS
DESCRIPTION:Presenter: Maggie Parr\n\nDate: Sunday\, September 20\, 2026\
 n\nTime: 12-2 PM\n\nLocation: San Rafael store\n\nFREE DEMO!!\n\nPainting
  a portrait in oil is much easier than you think! Using a three-step proc
 ess\, former Disney Imagineer Maggie Parr will demonstrate how to create 
 a beautiful painting that looks three-dimensional\, colorful\, and alive.
  All levels welcome.\n\n\n\nJOIN HER CLASS!\n\nOIL PAINTING FOR ALL LEVEL
 S\n(5) Thursday afternoons from September 24-October 22\, 2:30-5:30 pm\n\
 n$380 includes all materials—paint\, mediums\, and oil-primed linen canva
 s\n\nRegister for class: https://www.parrcreate.com/page/711614 https://w
 ww.parrcreate.com/page/711614\n\nOil painting doesn’t have to be intimida
 ting! In just four weeks\, students will paint a portrait in the indirect
  style\, starting with a grey value study\, building up with layers\, and
  finishing with powerful details. The final result always surprises peopl
 e: just by following basic rules\, anyone can create a beautiful oil port
 rait that glows. Even abstract painters can benefit from learning these t
 echniques.\n\nKnowing how oil painting works give us more confidence to d
 evelop our own authentic creative voice. As Maggie says\, “You gotta lear
 n the rules to break the rules.”\n\nMaggie Parr started her career workin
 g as a show designer at Walt Disney Imagineering\, where she designed the
 me park attractions around the world. She also expanded into book illustr
 ation\, murals\, portraits\, comics\, and eventually\, writing books and 
 scripts for television. She also developed her own painting practice. To 
 that end\, she studied with master teachers like Steve Huston\, Jeremy Li
 pking\, and Joseph Q. Daily. She got an MFA and taught at the college lev
 el\, then developed her own teaching methods for private and group study.
  Today\, Maggie maintains a thriving business creating custom art and des
 igns for corporations\, individuals\, and non-profits. She teaches other 
 artists to utilize classical rendering techniques so they can confidently
  break the rules in the service of their own work. And she coaches creati
 ves in search of deeper authenticity\, healing\, and self-actualization.\
 n\nMaggie Parr\nhttps://maggieparr.com https://maggieparr.com\n\nPhone: 3
 23.208.1226\n\nmailto:maggieparr@me.com mailto:maggieparr@me.com\n\nSign 
 up for newsletter https://maggieparr.kit.com/248b3f58df https://maggiepar
 r.kit.com/248b3f58df
CATEGORIES:San-Rafael,Art-Demo,Oil-Paint
