SUMMARY: Ongoing Gel Printing & Collage Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Magdalena Bogart\nDate: Monday\, September 21st\n
 Time: 1:00PM-4:00PM\nLocation: Santa Rosa Store\nFee: $45.00\n\n\nIn my o
 ngoing Gel-Printing & Collage workshop I want to offer you the opportunit
 y to collage with your handmade papers\, starting with an easy project pr
 ogressing each class to a more challenging one.\n\nI will demonstrate tec
 hniques for making papers with and without the Gel-Plate. We will create 
 a collection of cohesive\npapers. The best of them you will use for your 
 collage projects.\n\nSome examples are a fish\, a butterfly\, a vase with
  flowers\, a grouping of various cups and more.\n\nOne requirement for th
 is class is that you are familiar and comfortable cutting shapes with an 
 X-Acto knife or a similar tool.\n\nTo register for this workshop\, please
  contact Magdalena at: 408.781.2589 or by email\nat: mailto:mag.bogart@gm
 ail.com mailto:mag.bogart@gmail.com mag.bogart@gmail.com mailto:mag.bogar
