DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260922T170000
UID:260820ExunJ_Hw5Umawm_ULwvQUg
DESCRIPTION:Teen Tarot Tuesdays \\(For ages 13-17\\) \n\nEach month we'll
  focus on different aspects of tarot Designed for young people to learn t
 arot as a tool for self-discovery\, and mindfulness.These classes are low-
 pressure and no prior experience is needed.These focus on intuition\, art\
 , and personal reflection to help navigate everyday teen topics like scho
 ol stress\, friendships\, and creative goals.\n\nThis class will be held i
 n our Victorian parlor or our 1920s room\, to give it the vibe it deserves
 !\n\nBring your own tarot deck or use one of ours!\n\n$88 is for ALL four 
 weeks \\($22 each week\\)\n\n\\(Sometimes we may veer to tarot adjacent ca
 rds\, which we will provide\\)
URL:https://bookeo.com/spellcraftcurator?type=3152JLK4961A0160B1977
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
