SUMMARY:Tom Schwedhelm for Supervisor 2026 Community Engagement Series in 
 Windsor
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260922T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260922T193000
UID:260910TLlIlpLwvUGdU_UfB5xpDA
DESCRIPTION:I hope you will join us for Round 2 of Our Community Engagemen
 t Series. This is a series of 5 meetings in Northern Sonoma County\, with 
 meetings planned in Santa Rosa\, Windsor\, Geyserville\, Cloverdale and He
 aldsburg \\(more info on all meetings below\\). All meetings will run from
  5:30pm to 7:00pm and all are free to attend - I hope to see you there! I 
 am proud to be the only candidate for Supervisor hosting a Community Engag
 ement Series\, and welcome the opportunity to connect with you\, your neig
 hbors\, and all North County residents!\n\nTOM SCHWEDHELM’S COMMUNITY EN
 GAGEMENT SERIES\n\nFive Meetings to Choose From:\n\n1. SANTA ROSA: Tuesday
 \, September 15 at the Luther Burbank Center for the Arts \\(50 Mark West 
 Springs Road\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95403\\)\n\n2. WINDSOR: Tuesday\, September
  22 at the Windsor Community Center \\(901 Adele Drive\, Windsor\, CA 9549
 2\\)\n\n3. GEYSERVILLE: Monday\, September 28 at the at the Oriental Commu
 nity Hall \\(1000 Hwy 128\, Geyserville\, CA 95441\\)\n\n4. CLOVERDALE: Tu
 esday\, September 29 at the Cloverdale Citrus Fair Tea Room \\(1 Citrus Fa
 ir Drive\, Cloverdale\, CA 95425\\)\n\n5. HEALDSBURG: Thursday\, October 1
  at the Healdsburg High School Cafeteria/Multi-Purpose Room \\(1024 Prince
  Avenue\, Healdsburg\, CA 95448\\)
LOCATION:Windsor Community Center
URL:https://www.votetom.com/events
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
