SUMMARY:Great Women Mystics III
DESCRIPTION:Rosicrucians AMORC\, Santa Rosa\, CA\nThe AMORC book *Great Wo
 men Initiates* by Hélène Bernard brings more light to the extensive and 
 inspiring contributions of women to the spiritual evolvement of humanity. 
 We will follow up again on that book and consider further some of the grea
 t developments and lessons of mysticism exemplified in the lives of women.
  Join Hugh McCague as we continue to explore Rosicrucian laws and principl
 es and their creative expression and application for the mastery of life\,
  harmonious living\, and service.\n\n**Please RSVP to access log-in inform
 ation. Click ATTEND ONLINE below.**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/amorc-santa-rosa-pronaos/events/31637
 0749/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
