DESCRIPTION:Come sing\, move\, and play percussion instruments with us! Mu
 sic teacher and author Kim Milai takes you on a musical adventure for chil
 dren and their grownups. We will sing and move to songs like Starlight and
  Shoo Turkey. We will celebrate Hispanic Heritage Month with songs like Mi
  Chacra\, Que Llueva\, and Mi Cuerpo. ¡Vengan a ver mi biblioteca\, que e
 s hermosa! Afterwards feel free to stay and play\, or make a DIY water bot
 tle Guiro to take home. About the artist: Kim Milai has been teaching elem
 entary music for over 30 years. She specializes in folk songs and activiti
 es for PreK through 5thGrade.
