SUMMARY:Author Event: Grief Grit Glory by Pamela Jessup Runner
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260923T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260923T180000
UID:260831Q0CHsVuHr0KOVeekX1LcBg
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a special event with Pamela Jessup Runner\, author
  of Grief Grit Glory. This event is free\, but we appreciate your RSVP bel
 ow so we can plan for your attendance. ABOUT THE BOOK In this deeply movin
 g memoir\, Napa Valley author Pamela Jessup Runner shares her family’s e
 xtraordinary journey after the birth of her profoundly disabled son\, Jonn
 y. Through heartbreak\, advocacy\, faith\, perseverance\, and unconditiona
 l love\, Pamela invites readers into a story that explores what it means t
 o continue choosing hope through life’s most difficult seasons. From the
  vineyards of Napa Valley to the realities of disability caregiving and fa
 mily devotion\, Grief Grit Glory is a powerful story of motherhood\, purpo
 se\, and the enduring strength of family. Praised by early readers as “d
 eeply moving\,” “heartfelt\,” and “impossible to put down\,” thi
 s memoir offers encouragement and understanding for anyone navigating grie
 f\, caregiving\, uncertainty\, or personal transformation. For additional 
 information and media\, you may also visit: Website: https://griefgritglor
 y.com/ Book trailer\, podcast https://www.youtube.com/@PamelaJessupRunner 
 ABOUT THE AUTHOR Pamela Jessup Runner writes from the heart in her memoir 
 about motherhood\, faith\, and the strength it takes to hold a family toge
 ther. Her storytelling is shaped by a life journey that has included advoc
 acy for families of children with disabilities\, entrepreneurship in Napa 
 Valley’s wine community\, and the enduring lessons of love and persevera
 nce. Now residing in Sacramento with her husband George\, Pam finds inspir
 ation in family life\, time at their Tahoe retreat\, and traveling the wor
 ld while continuing to write. Her debut memoir\, Grief Grit Glory\, shares
  these experiences\, with more stories from her life in Napa Valley yet to
  come.
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/2880421678970944/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
