DESCRIPTION:An Inspiring Conversation with Anne Lamott: On Hope\, Humor\, 
 and Living Fully\n\nJoin bestselling author Anne Lamott for an evening of 
 laugh-out-loud wit\, wisdom\, and heartfelt conversation. Known for belove
 d books including Bird by Bird and Traveling Mercies\, Lamott has spent de
 cades helping readers navigate life's joys and challenges with honesty\, h
 umor\, and grace.\n\nIn this moderated discussion\, she will share insight
 s on hope\, resilience\, creativity\, and finding meaning in an imperfect 
 world.\n\nWednesday\, September 23\, 2026 Green Music Center\, Sonoma Stat
 e University\n\n6:00 - 7:00 \n\nBook signing to follow!\n\nTickets: \n\n$3
 8 at GMC Box Office \n\n$44 Online\n\nFor tickets and information\, visit 
 socowomenevents.com.
