DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260924T113000
UID:260820mA6PEBzxGEytCIAQH_pxPQ
DESCRIPTION:Spoken word artists wishing to share their original poetry on 
 the radio are welcome to join in a live studio broadcast on the 4th Thursd
 ay of the month. Poets take turns at the mic open mic style for an hour lo
 ng poetry show.\n\nThe public can listen to the broadcast on OZCAT 89.5FM 
 KZCT\, or stream online. Hosted by DJ LaLa\, poets have been sharing their
  work live on air since 2018.\n\nPoets should arrive 15 minutes early. The
  venue\, located in a historic Victorian home\, is only accessible via sta
 irs. Please contact Benicia Poet Laureate Emeritus Tom Stanton at skipperw
 icky@gmail.com for the possibility of submitting an .mp3 in lieu of in per
 son performance.
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/2120553825431551/2120553858764881/
