DESCRIPTION:**September 24 -** Joshua Moreno examines the overlapping rela
 tionship between the natural and human-made environment and highlight patt
 erns and systems of efficiency that exist within them. Through installatio
 n\, drawing\, and film\, he re-evaluates the everyday spaces and objects t
 hat surround us\, with added attention to elemental phenomena.
