SUMMARY: Paint an Oil Portrait
DESCRIPTION:\nCLASS: OIL PAINTING FOR ALL LEVELS\n$380 includes all mater
 ials—paint\, mediums\, and oil-primed linen canvas\n\nRegister for class:
  https://www.parrcreate.com/page/711614 https://www.parrcreate.com/page/7
 11614\n\n https://www.parrcreate.com/page/711614\nOil painting doesn’t ha
 ve to be intimidating! In just four weeks\, students will paint a portrai
 t in the indirect style\, starting with a grey value study\, building up 
 with layers\, and finishing with powerful details. The final result alway
 s surprises people: just by following basic rules\, anyone can create a b
 eautiful oil portrait that glows. Even abstract painters can benefit from
  learning these techniques.\n\nKnowing how oil painting works gives us mo
 re confidence to develop our own authentic creative voice. As Maggie says
 \, “You gotta learn the rules to break the rules.”\n\nMaggie Parr started
  her career working as a show designer at Walt Disney Imagineering\, wher
 e she designed theme park attractions around the world. She also expanded
  into book illustration\, murals\, portraits\, comics\, and eventually\, 
 writing books and scripts for television. She also developed her own pain
 ting practice. To that end\, she studied with master teachers like Steve 
 Huston\, Jeremy Lipking\, and Joseph Q. Daily. She got an MFA and taught 
 at the college level\, then developed her own teaching methods for privat
 e and group study. Today\, Maggie maintains a thriving business creating 
 custom art and designs for corporations\, individuals\, and non-profits.\
 n\nShe teaches other artists to utilize classical rendering techniques so
  they can confidently break the rules in the service of their own work. A
 nd she coaches creatives in search of deeper authenticity\, healing\, and
  self-actualization.\n\n\nForms of contact below.\n\nhttp://www.maggiepar
 r.com http://www.maggieparr.com\n\nPhone: 323.208.1226\n\nmailto:maggiepa
 rr@me.com mailto:maggieparr@me.com\n\n
CATEGORIES:San-Rafael,Oil-Paint,Portrait
