DESCRIPTION:**Get ready to dig in at the Children’s Museum of Sonoma Cou
 nty! FUNstruction\, taking place Friday\, September 25\, 2026 from 4:30 
 to 8:00 PM\, is a one-of-a-kind Family Fun Night celebrating all things co
 nstruction while kicking off the next exciting chapter of the Museum’s f
 uture.**\n\n**Here’s what’s in store:**\n\n**🚜 Explore impressive c
 onstruction vehicles and heavy machinery on display\, thanks to our partne
 rs at GMH Builders**\n\n**🔨 Build\, create\, and experiment with hands
 -on construction-themed activities and engineering challenges**\n\n**💥 
 Be part of the excitement as we celebrate the official groundbreaking of t
 he Museum expansion**\n\n**🍺 Local craft beer and 🍷 Sonoma County wi
 nes for the grown-ups (available for purchase)**\n\n**🍔 Delicious eats 
 from local food trucks (available for purchase)**\n\n**🎶 Family-friendl
 y entertainment**\n\n**Grab your hard hats (or your favorite construction 
 gear!) and bring the whole family for an evening of building\, discovery\,
  and celebration. It’s a chance to make history together as we break gro
 und on a bigger\, better Children’s Museum for generations to come!**
LOCATION:Children's Museum of Sonoma County
URL:https://www.cmosc.org/event/family-funstuction/2026-09-25/
