SUMMARY:Bongs + Books Silent Book Club at The Lounge at Mercy
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260925T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260925T200000
UID:260625MRfsfbUku0e4e98fiLSwLg
DESCRIPTION:Because sometimes the best kind of community… is quiet.🌿
 📖\n\nNo assigned books\, no deadlines\, no discussions you have to part
 icipate in — just a shared space to unwind\, light up\, and get lost in 
 a good read. Bring whatever you’re currently reading \\(or listening to 
 - we have coloring books and puzzles for our audiobook lovers!\\)\, grab s
 omething to smoke\, and settle in for a cozy night of uninterrupted readin
 g alongside fellow book lovers.\n\nCome solo or with friends and enjoy com
 fy vibes\, good weed\, and a room full of people happily minding their own
  business.\n\nHow it works:\n\n5-6pm: Arrive\, get settled\, and kick thin
 gs off with a short welcome sesh.\n\n6-7pm: Uninterrupted reading time\, l
 o-fi music\, and chill energy.\n\n7-8pm: wrap up chapters\, meet other rea
 ders\, one last sesh to end the evening!
LOCATION:The Lounge at Mercy
URL:https://bookclubs.com/bongs-books-silent-book-club/join/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
