DESCRIPTION:Step into a higher class of cannabis. **Elevated Sessions** is
  an intimate\, sommelier-led tasting experience featuring award winning **
 Moon Valley** indoor flower and curated for the true cannabis connoisseur.
   \n\nJoin us for a refined **60 minute** session designed to awaken the
  senses. Your cannabis sommelier will guide you through **4 exceptional cu
 ltivars** — exploring their terpene profiles\, aromas\, flavors\, and ef
 fects — while you savor a drink from the natural soda bar\, curated snac
 ks\, and palate cleansers.\n\nThis is more than a tasting — it’s an im
 mersive journey through craft cannabis\, where every detail is designed to
  elevate your evening\, from the intimate atmosphere to the exclusive perk
 s awaiting guests.\n\n**Date & Sessions**\n\n**Date:** Friday\, September 
 25\, 2026\n\n**ONE Session:** 6:00 PM - 9:00PM\n\n**Capacity:** (36 ticket
 s total)\n\n**What’s Included**\n\n**Enjoy a refreshing Natural Soda** 
 – A cannabis-infused palate opener\n\n**Guided Tasting of 4 Curated Stra
 ins** –Guests enjoy exclusive cultivar drop\n\n**Tasting Passport** – 
 Track aromas\, effects\, and personal favorites\n\n**Charcuterie & Palate 
 Cleansers** – Light bites designed for the session\n\n**Meet The Grower*
 * – Learn how this award-winning flower was grown\n\n**Exclusive Perks**
  – Discounts + access to limited drops\n\n**Tickets**\n\n**6:00 PM Tasti
 ng - $75:** Includes 🌱 $50 Goodie Bag\, 4 Curated Tastings\, Tasting Pa
 ssport\, Natural Soda Bar\, Snacks & Exclusive Deals\n\n21+ Only | DCC # C
 12-0000420-LIC\n\n**Event Terms & Conditions**\n\nThis event is 21+ only. 
 Valid government-issued ID is required for entry. By attending this event 
 at the Mercy Wellness Lounge\, you acknowledge that photography and video 
 recording may take place. Images and footage may be used by Mercy Wellness
  for marketing and promotional purposes across various channels\, without 
 compensation. Tickets are non-refundable unless otherwise stated. Event de
 tails\, timing\, or programming are subject to change.\n\nCannabis consump
 tion is limited to designated areas and must comply with all applicable lo
 cal and state regulations. Please consume responsibly.\n\nBy entering the 
 venue\, you agree to comply with all house rules and venue policies.
LOCATION:The Lounge at Mercy 
URL:https://eventhi.io/events/elevated-sessions-at-the-lounge-at-mercy-925
 26-15017
