DESCRIPTION:The Joni Mitchell Situation offers a stirring and light-hearte
 d celebration of songs\, crossing the genres of Folk\, Jazz\, and Rock\, a
 ll composed by the incomparable singer/songwriter\, Joni Mitchell. With Ka
 te Foley-Beining on vocals\, dulcimer\, and guitar\, backed by Sonoma Coun
 ty jazz greats: Tom Shader on bass\, Kevin Dillon on drums\, and Christian
  Foley-Beining on electric guitar\, the Joni Mitchell Situation explores w
 ith humor and depth Mitchell's range of sounds and styles\, from ballads t
 o Jaco-infused jazz art songs. Always new selections from Joni's expansive
  songbook.
