DESCRIPTION:**Are you looking to part ways with a loved item\, or in need 
 of something for your home?**\n\n**Come to the Reuse Bazaar!**\n\nBring yo
 ur items\, or just shop (for free) from what others bring\, to the **Grace
  Pavilion at the Sonoma County Fairgrounds (1350 Bennett Valley Rd.\, Sant
 a Rosa).**\n\nOnce the event concludes\, leftover items in good condition 
 will be donated to local thrift stores and non-profit organizations. This 
 event is open to all residents in Sonoma and Marin counties. Each resident
  can bring one vehicle of items\, with a maximum of three cubic yards of i
 tems per vehicle.
LOCATION:Grace Pavilion at the Sonoma County Fairgrounds
URL:https://www.srcity.org/3988/Zero-Waste-Reuse-Bazaar
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat, Visit Santa Rosa
