UID:260519J0cZkitNfkSHA81_fPTJRw
DESCRIPTION:Experience a one-of-a-kind night of entertainment as With Regr
 et Presents transforms the spectacular subterranean wine cave at Deerfield
  Ranch Winery into an intimate\, premium comedy club. This exclusive showc
 ase features a hand-picked lineup of the Bay Area’s top stand-up comedia
 ns performing live inside the winery's stunning cave tunnels. Guests can e
 njoy award-winning local wines and delicious dining options available insi
 de the cave before the laughter begins. Perfect for a unique date night or
  an unforgettable evening out in the valley. Doors open at 5:00 PM for win
 e and food\, and the comedy showcase kicks off promptly at 7:00 PM. Seatin
 g inside the cave is strictly limited. Advanced ticket purchase is highly 
 recommended.
