X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://eventhi.io/events/mercys-highly-talented-14966", "Press Democrat": "https://eventhi.io/events/mercys-highly-talented-14966"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://eventhi.io/events/mercys-highly-talented-14966"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Mercy Presents: HIGHly Talented
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T220000
UID:260909ybhshhsL_UCjR1ZpcWDGgg
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a talent show with a little extra spark. **High
 ly Talented** takes over **The Lounge at Mercy** on Saturday\, Septembe
 r 26 for a night of live performances\, crowd participation\, cannabis\, a
 nd seriously entertaining local talent.\n\nSingers\, dancers\, comedians\,
  musicians\, specialty acts\, and more will take the stage and show us wha
 t they’ve got. With **live judges and an audience vote**\, you won’t 
 just be watching the show—you’ll be part of deciding who comes out on 
 top.\n\nThe top performer **gets $500** and will be featured in upcoming
  Mercy Wellness email marketing. Think you've got what it takes to win?? S
 ign up here for a shot at performing: https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1F
 AIpQLSdhFtXvM6Z5InoYlcBwB4LZAgHku9gZ1ASYTOZRL3FvRMeqOA/viewform?usp=header
 \n\nCome early\, get settled in\, enjoy the lounge\, and get ready to chee
 r on your favorites when the show starts.\n\n**Date & Time**\n\n**Date:**
  Saturday\, September 26\, 2026\n\n**Pre-Party:** 6:00 PM\n\n**Talent Sh
 ow:** 7:00 PM – 10:00 PM\n\n**What to Expect**\n\n🎤 **Live Performa
 nces**\n\nWatch local performers bring their best to the Highly Talented s
 tage.\n\n⭐ **Live Judges**\n\nOur judges will be watching\, reacting\, 
 and helping narrow down the competition.\n\n👏 **Audience Vote**\n\nThe
  crowd gets a say. Come ready to support your favorite act and help decide
  who rises to the top.\n\n💰 **Winner Gets $500**\n\nOne performer will
  leave the stage with bigger pockets and a feature in upcoming Mercy Welln
 ess email marketing.\n\n🌿 **An Elevated Night Out**\n\nEnjoy the show 
 inside The Lounge at Mercy with good people\, great entertainment\, and ev
 en better smoke.\n\n**Tickets**\n\n**🐦 Early Bird General Admission —
  Available Through September 4**\n\nLock in early bird pricing for general
  admission before it’s gone.\n\n**🎟 General Admission**\n\nEntry to 
 **Highly Talented** with access to the full talent show from 6–10 PM.\n
 \nSeating is subject to availability\, so arrive early\, get comfortable\,
  and settle in before the performances begin.\n\n**Think You’re Highly T
 alented?**\n\nWe’re still looking for performers to take the stage.\n\n*
 *Audition sign-ups close September 18.**\n\nContestants who sign up receiv
 e:\n\n✨ A goodie bag\n\n🎟 One additional General Admission ticket for
  a guest\n\n💰 The opportunity to get **$500**\n\n📧 A feature in upc
 oming Mercy Wellness email marketing if selected as the winner\n\nAudition
  registration and talent submission are handled separately from General Ad
 mission tickets.\n\n**A Talent Show With a Little Extra Spark.**\n\n**21+ 
