BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://shop.coyotesonoma.com/country-line-dancing-with-dustin-saylor--the-stowaways-926-p255.aspx", "Press Democrat": "https://shop.coyotesonoma.com/country-line-dancing-with-dustin-saylor--the-stowaways-926-p255.aspx"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://shop.coyotesonoma.com/country-line-dancing-with-dustin-saylor--the-stowaways-926-p255.aspx"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Country Line Dancing Night ft. Dustin Saylor & The Stowaways
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T190000
UID:260822DnpFWbAaiU-mZy-Yr5Dcaw
DESCRIPTION:**Date:** Saturday\, September 26\, 2026\n\n**Time:** Doors 6
  PM | Lessons 7-8 PM | Live music throughout the night\n\n**Tickets:** $20
  Advance | $25 Door | Coyote Sonoma Members Receive $5 Off\n\nJoin us for 
 line dancing lessons from Grapevine Dance! Plus live music from Dustin Say
 lor & The Stowaways.\n\nAbout Dustin Saylor:\n\nDustin Saylor\, a Northern
  California-born country singer-songwriter\, has made a name for himself a
 s the #1 Country/Folk artist in the San Francisco Bay Area. His musical jo
 urney began in childhood\, first at the piano and later as a guitarist and
  singer for his high school youth group and local church. Despite early ch
 allenges\, including a devastating American Idol rejection in 2009\, Saylo
 r had a transformative moment on his long drive home\, realizing that true
  success required full commitment. Embracing his calling\, he quit bartend
 ing\, pursued a music degree at Sonoma State University\, and became a ful
 l-time musician. Over the years\, he has performed alongside artists like 
 Tyler Rich\, Chase Rice\, and Daughtry\, with his sound often compared to 
 Thomas Rhett and Chris Stapleton. His songwriting is deeply personal\, sha
 ped by his early experiences of adoption and the contrasting struggles and
  joys of his life. Through his music\, Saylor seeks to inspire\, heal\, an
 d create a space where people can connect beyond labels. Committed to his 
 craft\, he remains "all in\," determined to sing and play music for the re
 st of his life.
LOCATION:Coyote Sonoma
URL:https://shop.coyotesonoma.com/country-line-dancing-with-dustin-saylor-
 -the-stowaways-926-p255.aspx
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
