X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Press Democrat": "https://www.cloverdaleperformingarts.com/events/story-wrens"}
X-SOURCE-ID:pressdemocrat
SUMMARY:Story Wrens
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260926T213000
UID:260821HAs60OYWiEmEuOtzekkJ9w
DESCRIPTION:...traditional folk music trio\, the Story Wrens...  We speci
 alize in historical story songs of the British Isles\, and we perform regu
 larly throughout California\, with recent events including the KVMR Celtic
  festival\, the Booster House Concert series\, and the Getty Museum in Los
  Angeles.\n\nOur music features three-part harmonies accompanied by tenor 
 mandolin\, Celtic harp\, cello\, fiddle\, whistle\, and other instruments\
 , and our trio includes a wonderful lead singer/storyteller and a harper w
 ho has played on a Joan Baez album and guested with the Chieftains.
LOCATION:Cloverdale Performing Arts Center
URL:https://www.cloverdaleperformingarts.com/events/story-wrens
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
