SUMMARY:September Plein Air Watercolors at Ragle  — Sebastopol Center Fo
 r the Arts\, California
DTSTART:20260927T000000
DTEND:20260928T000000
UID:38e6dcd964174fc1ccec4800731a33bf@sebarts.org
DESCRIPTION:September Plein Air Watercolors at Ragle\n\n  \n    \n      \n
         \n          $85.00\n        \n      \n    \n  \n\nSunday\, Septemb
 er 27th 10:00am-2:00pm$75.00 + $10.00 materials fee In this single-session
  workshop\, participants will learn watercolor technique\, as well as the 
 basics of painting landscapes from life. Students will choose a scene to p
 aint and receive instruction on composition\, color temperature and value\
 , and perspective. With a mixture of demonstrations and individual instru
 ction\, artists of all experience levels can learn something new and have 
 a positive creative encounter. Enjoy a day in our beautiful local park\, a
 nd gain a new appreciation for the beauty of your surroundings through clo
 se observation and careful rendering. Feel free to bring a plein air set 
 up if you have one\, or a lightweight folding chair. Otherwise seating is 
 at picnic tables and park benches or on the ground. All other materials ar
 e provided. Location disclosed the day before the session in a welcome ema
 il. About the Instructor: Hannah Day received her BA in Visual Arts with a
 n emphasis on drawing and printmaking from University of San Diego\, then 
 attended University of Hawaii at Manoa to receive her MFA in printmaking. 
 Hannah’s etchings have been internationally shown and collected\, but he
 r art practice also includes paper cutting\, graphite\, and watercolor. Sh
 e has taught all ages in many mediums. These days\, Hannah primarily teach
 es watercolor\, observational drawing\, and paper cutting. You can view he
 r work at www.hannahdrawstrees.com\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n
 \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n          \n            \n              \n      
           Add to cart
LOCATION:Sebastopol Center for the Arts\, 282 S High St\, Sebastopol\, CA 
 95472
