DESCRIPTION:The North Bay Heart Walk is the American Heart Association’s
  premier event for raising funds. It’s an opportunity to support the Hea
 rt Association’s efforts to change the landscape of health and wellness 
 while making an impact in the communities in which we live and work.\n\nEv
 ery walker\, every dollar donated\, means more people trained in lifesavin
 g CPR\, more research and lifesaving moments for everyone and continuing t
 o make an impact on health equity. Your dedication to the mission will hel
 p us to analyze\, connect\, innovate\, influence\,and invest in advancing 
