DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260927T170000
UID:260805OcVrAYApQkqwnSdi25i1OA
DESCRIPTION:We want to hear from you!\n\nBuilt by early settlers in 1874\,
  the Tomales Town Hall is one of the oldest continually used community bui
 ldings in California. We're a 501\\(c\\)3 non-profit with a 152-year-old b
 uilding at the heart of the village of Tomales.\n\nCome to our community c
 heck-in. The trustees of the town hall would like to share our upcoming ev
 ent calendar\, programs\, finances\, progress on renovation\, and voluntee
 r opportunities. This is your chance to give us feedback. We'll have a hos
 ted bar and some nibbles.
LOCATION:Tomales Town Hall
URL:https://www.tomalestownhall.org/events
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
