UID:260102G58nmXNrb0i6prWCnXwKrg
DESCRIPTION:Join us Sunday\, September 28th for the 10th annual Railroad S
 quare Music Festival!  Bands and vendors apply here https://www.railroadsq
 uaremusicfestival.com/contact Interested sponsors please email railroadsqu
 aremusicfestival@gmail.com Railroad Square Music Festival is a FREE day of
  music in Santa Rosa's Historic Railroad Square.  The Railroad Square Musi
 c Festival is a project of The Lost Church\, a non-profit organization ded
 icated to the belief that people need beautiful\, intimate performance spa
 ces to share their ideas\, stories and arts. The mission of the festival i
 s... To expand our local music community by creating an unforgettable acce
 ssible music experiences for visitors and locals alike. To show the world 
 that the North Bay is a vibrant arts hub and encourage people to come here
  to experience the scene for themselves. To send a message to North Bay pe
 rformers that they should shoot for the stars and feel proud about their i
 mportant role in the community.
LOCATION:Davis and 4th St.
URL:https://www.visitsantarosa.com/events/#jlupcoming-events
