X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Tockify Rileystreet.Art.Com": "https://tockify.com/rileystreet.art.com/detail/568/1790623800000"}
X-SOURCE-ID:tockify_rileystreet.art.com
X-SOURCE:Riley Street Art Supply
UID:TKF/640bd014795edf4fa3769b14/568/29843730/0/0
DTSTART:20260928T193000Z
DTEND:20260929T003000Z
URL:https://tockify.com/rileystreet.art.com/detail/568/1790623800000
SUMMARY: Drawing Autumn Leaves with Colored Pencil
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Victoria A. Kochergin\n\nDate: September 28th\, 2
 025\n\nTime: 12:30PM-5:30PM\nLocation: Santa Rosa Store\n\n$95.00\n\nAutu
 mn is that special time of year when we are able to explore and enjoy the
  variety of seasonal colors\, as yellow\, red\, brown and orange leaves a
 dorn the trees. This workshop will delve into drawing autumn leaves using
  colored pencil as a medium. The first portion of class will focus on col
 ored pencil principles and techniques such as underpainting\, embossing\,
  weaving of colors and creating color palettes. After a short break\, the
  afternoon will be dedicated to hands-on drawing time with individual one
 -on-one assistance and a demo. All levels welcomed.\n\nMaterials list to 
 be emailed once registration is completed.\n\nTo register\, please contac
 t Victoria at kochergi@sonic.net mailto:kochergi@sonic.net or (707) 479-3
 336.\n\nVictoria A. Kochergin is a local botanical artist and instructor 
 who works with colored pencil and acrylics. Her artwork has been exhibite
 d in galleries\, wineries\, botanical gardens\, international shows and o
 n Alcatraz. For more information about Victoria\, please visit her websit
 e at www.victoriakochergin.com http://www.victoriakochergin.com/\n\nImage
 : “Autumn Oak Leaves” © 2013
