X-SOURCE-ID:pressdemocrat
SUMMARY:Tom Schwedhelm for Supervisor 2026 Community Engagement Series Clo
 verdale
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260929T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260929T193000
UID:260910E9G6hNhxmU2DzJiVXwiFHA
DESCRIPTION:I hope you will join us for Round 2 of Our Community Engagemen
 t Series. This is a series of 5 meetings in Northern Sonoma County\, with 
 meetings planned in Santa Rosa\, Windsor\, Geyserville\, Cloverdale and He
 aldsburg (more info on all meetings below). All meetings will run from 5:3
 0pm to 7:00pm and all are free to attend - I hope to see you there! I am p
 roud to be the only candidate for Supervisor hosting a Community Engagemen
 t Series\, and welcome the opportunity to connect with you\, your neighbor
 s\, and all North County residents!\n\nTOM SCHWEDHELM’S COMMUNITY ENGAGE
 MENT SERIES\n\nFive Meetings to Choose From:\n\n1\\. SANTA ROSA: Tuesday\,
  September 15 at the Luther Burbank Center for the Arts (50 Mark West Spri
 ngs Road\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95403)\n\n2\\. WINDSOR: Tuesday\, September 22 
 at the Windsor Community Center (901 Adele Drive\, Windsor\, CA 95492)\n\n
 3\\. GEYSERVILLE: Monday\, September 28 at the at the Oriental Community H
 all (1000 Hwy 128\, Geyserville\, CA 95441)\n\n4\\. CLOVERDALE: Tuesday\, 
 September 29 at the Cloverdale Citrus Fair Tea Room (1 Citrus Fair Drive\,
  Cloverdale\, CA 95425)\n\n5\\. HEALDSBURG: Thursday\, October 1 at the He
 aldsburg High School Cafeteria/Multi-Purpose Room (1024 Prince Avenue\, He
 aldsburg\, CA 95448)
LOCATION:Cloverdale Citrus Fair (Tea Room)
URL:https://www.votetom.com/events
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
