 ainment Weekly\\)\, she has collaborated with artists like Vanessa Carlton
  \\(she co-wrote Carlton’s latest album Love is an Art\\) and Jenny Lewi
 s \\(playing in the Voyager touring band\\)\, and opened to critical accla
 im for artists ranging from Robyn Hitchcock to Television.
