SUMMARY:Ultimate Heirloom Apple Tasting Experience at Gold Ridge Organic F
 arms
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261002T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261002T153000
UID:260830LbuuycVeOEiaIQoGn-wYVA
DESCRIPTION:Start with a guided walk through our organic apple orchards\, 
 where guests will learn how our trees are grown and what apples and people
  have in common \\(hint: no two are alike\\). Enjoy the expansive views of
  the rolling hills and farms surrounding our 88-acre property in southwest
  Sebastopol.\n\nThen\, enjoy a side-by-side tasting of four to five hand-p
 icked heirloom apples\, paired with local artisan cheeses drizzled with ou
 r apple cider syrup and a taste of freshly pressed apple juice.\n\nThis is
  a limited-time experience offered only during harvest season\, when our a
 pples are at their peak. Spaces are limited\, so we encourage you to book 
 soon and secure your spot for an unforgettable afternoon celebrating the m
 agic of heirloom apples.
LOCATION:Gold Ridge Organic Farms
URL:https://www.exploretock.com/gold-ridge-organic-farms/experience/494119
 /ultimate-heirloom-apple-tasting-orchard-experience
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
