X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/sacred-sound-sessions-ancient-eastern-music-meets-modern-beats-with-mah-ze-tar/?lang=en"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Sacred Sound Sessions: Ancient Eastern Music & Modern Beats with M
 āh Ze Tār
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261002T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261002T210000
UID:260820mCA97-O5bESWIxi5mK4HXA
DESCRIPTION:Māh Ze Tār is propelled by the vision of fusing traditional 
 eastern music with modern electronic composition as a form of cultural pre
 servation. Each Māh Ze Tār set is uniquely dynamic. You can expect to he
 ar the ancient sounds of the Sitar and Oud in one song and the timeless me
 lodies of the Ney and Duduk in the next. The arc of this set will bring a 
 kaleidoscope of emotions through mesmerizing vocals and grooving beats. M
 āh Ze Tār seeks to make familiar that which may seem “other” through
  weaving time-honored Eastern sounds with danceable bass lines and beats.
LOCATION:Spirit Rock Meditation Center
URL:https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/sacred-sound-sessions-
 ancient-eastern-music-meets-modern-beats-with-mah-ze-tar/?lang=en
