DESCRIPTION:Today's &quot\;Sugarbear&quot\; consists of Ivan Bailey on bas
 s\, John McLaughlin on lead guitar\, and Eric Chick on drums.  Ivan and Jo
 hn have been together about 44 years.  Started out in Miami as &quot\;The 
 Goldtones&quot\;\, later changed to &quot\;The Roustabouts&quot\;.  Moved 
 to the Ocala area and became &quot\;The Merger&quot\; and in 1972 changed 
 the name to &quot\;Sugarbear&quot\;.  Eric joined in 2002.\n\n The band is
  still very popular all around Marion County.  Check out their website at 
   www.sugarbearband.freespaces.com\n\n Their sound is sweeter than ever!
