UID:2608317VZwRzpfn024VVxLjMQiFg
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the season at deLorimier Winery's annual  Harvest Op
 en House ! Guests are invited to toast the harvest with new wine releases 
 and award-winning selections from the Sonoma County Harvest Fair. Enjoy an
  afternoon of tasting exceptional wines in the scenic setting of Alexander
  Valley\, surrounded by the beauty of the vineyards at their peak. This fe
 stive gathering is the perfect way to savor the fruits of the season\, con
 nect with fellow wine enthusiasts\, and experience the craftsmanship that 
 makes deLorimier Winery so special. Whether you're discovering new favorit
 es or revisiting beloved classics\, the Fall Open House offers a warm and 
 welcoming celebration of harvest\, community\, and Sonoma County wines.
