UID:260820okGJ-PUggUG1QChSS8PkQQ
DESCRIPTION:*Think your chili has what it takes to win the Golden Spoon. O
 r just want to taste your way through the competition and support your fav
 orite team?*\n\n*Come stir things up at the Napa Moose Lodge Annual Chili 
 Cook-Off and Craft Fair! This family-friendly event is open to the public 
 and features chili tastings\, live music\, drinks and an indoor craft fair
 .*\n\n *Admission is $10 for adults and children and includes chili tastin
 gs. Want to compete? Team entry is $40 for teams of up to four people.*\n\
 n*Event Schedule:*\n\n*\\-9:00 a.m. – Team cooking begins*\n\n*\\-11:00 
 a.m. – Doors open\; live music\, drinks and craft fair begin*\n\n*\\-12:
 30 p.m. – Chili tasting begins*\n\n*\\-2:15–2:30 p.m. – Winners anno
 unced*\n\n*Bring your appetite and help crown this year’s champions!*
