X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.exploretock.com/kostabrowne/experience/603315/golden-hour-at-kosta-browne"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Golden Hour at Kosta Browne
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T173000
UID:2607143e9lEQxH8kOrB8o9LheZvA
DESCRIPTION:Kosta Browne is opening their courtyard with wines by the glas
 s. Enjoy that stretch of light that lingers. See where the night takes you
 . It all begins here.\n\nKosta Browne crafts Pinot Noir and Chardonnay fro
 m the wild edges of California’s coast and the revered hillsides of Burg
 undy. The courtyard in Sebastopol’s Barlow is where those wines get open
 ed.
