SUMMARY:Don Pasquale
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T203000
UID:260715L3CFD3YLCkObbh-iFkdcnQ
DESCRIPTION:Poor Ernesto! His love life is in ruins thanks to his tyrannic
 al uncle\, the grumpy Don Pasquale who forbids him from marrying the cleve
 r and charming Norina. But with the help of the scheming Dr. Malatesta\, l
 ove and laughter prevail. Sung in one brisk\, 90-minute act\, this sparkli
 ng comedy delivers on every note-every laugh. Pocket Opera presents Donize
 tti's delightful one-act comic opera in English. This charming piece is ti
 meless\, witty and tender and features Robby Stafford\, Abigail Bush\, Ors
 on Van Gay\, and Ryan Braford. Conducted by Paul Dab with stage direction 
 by Bethanie Baeyen.
URL:https://creativesonoma.org/event/don-pasquale/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
