BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Press Democrat": "https://www.cloverdaleperformingarts.com/events/tales-of-expense-3-classic-radio-dramas-live-on-stage"}
X-SOURCE-ID:pressdemocrat
SUMMARY:Tales of Suspense - 3 Classic Radio Dramas Live on Stage
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T213000
UID:260821XXfsxCwtTk2xBfdkq3PlPA
DESCRIPTION:Step back into the Golden Age of Radio as Cloverdale Performin
 g Arts Center presents three unforgettable tales of mystery and suspense\,
  performed live with voice actors\, sound effects\, and music created befo
 re your eyes.\n\nThe Monkey's Paw tells the chilling story of a mysterious
  talisman that grants three wishes—but at a terrible cost. A timeless su
 pernatural thriller that reminds us to be careful what we wish for.\n\nThe
  House in Cypress Canyon follows a newlywed couple whose dream home become
 s the setting for an unexplainable and terrifying mystery. As strange even
 ts unfold\, the line between reality and nightmare begins to blur.\n\nThe 
 Maltese Falcon\, adapted from the classic detective story\, plunges audien
 ces into a world of deception\, danger\, and intrigue as private investiga
 tor Sam Spade searches for a priceless treasure while navigating a web of 
 unforgettable characters.\n\nJoin us for an evening of classic radio drama
  where every sound sparks the imagination and every story keeps you on the
  edge of your seat.
LOCATION:Cloverdale Performing Arts Center
URL:https://www.cloverdaleperformingarts.com/events/tales-of-expense-3-cla
 ssic-radio-dramas-live-on-stage
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
