X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://shop.coyotesonoma.com/illeagles-103-p248.aspx", "Press Democrat": "https://shop.coyotesonoma.com/illeagles-103-p248.aspx"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://shop.coyotesonoma.com/illeagles-103-p248.aspx"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:ILLEAGLES - The Premier Tribute to the Music of the Eagles
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261003T200000
UID:260822JbYaY8Mxk0qUa7MdXdTFjQ
DESCRIPTION:**Date:** Saturday\, October 3\, 2026\n\n**Time:** Doors 6 P
 M | Show 8 PM\n\n**Tickets:** $35\n\n**Food Vendor:** TBA\n\nWhat do peop
 le want when they go see a live band? The members of SF Bay Area based tri
 bute band ILLEAGLES believe that everyone in the crowd wants to be engaged
  and captivated from the first note until the show is done. Over the past 
 year and a half of sold out performances\, that is exactly what every crow
 d has gotten.\n\nILLEAGLES was founded in late 2016 when 6 friends came to
 gether who all had 2 things in common: 1) they loved the music of the Eagl
 es\, and 2) each member was an amazing musician in their own right. This c
 ommon vision led to hours and hours of studying\, rehearsing\, and masteri
 ng each of the Eagles classic hits.\n\nFrom rockers Life in the Fast Lane 
 and Heartache Tonight\, to swooning ballads Desperado and Best of My Love\
 , ILLEAGLES not only reproduce the soaring guitars\, multi-part harmonies 
 and tightness of the original band\, but also add their own brand of swagg
 er and energy that keeps fans coming back over and over. It's commonplace 
 for a majority of the audience to start singing along on the first song\, 
 and continuing to sing until the show is over (or they lose their voices).
 \n\nILLEAGLES- A high energy\, unforgettable party that leaves fans wantin
 g more...
LOCATION:Coyote Sonoma
URL:https://shop.coyotesonoma.com/illeagles-103-p248.aspx
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
