SUMMARY:Grand Bazaar of Petaluma
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261004T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261004T150000
UID:260912WKLFjJlupU-KUu0tESk24w
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an lively\, in-person marketplace bursting with un
 ique finds from over 125 talented artists\, crafters\, and vendors\, showc
 asing a exciting mix of creative treasures — from festive holiday décor
  and gifts to rare collectibles and one-of-a-kind art. Every day brings so
 mething new to explore!\n\nBrowse an incredible selection of products\, in
 cluding jewelry\, clothing\, art\, woodworking\, glasswork\, pottery\, kid
 s’ toys\, miniatures\, candles\, soaps\, and much more. Discover beautif
 ul vintage and handmade pieces\, plus practical essentials like pet access
 ories and gift cards.  Featuring tasty treats from Sax's Joint\, Kona Ice
 \, Pupusas la Bendicion\, and more.\n\nProceeds from this event benefit Mi
 cah’s Hugs\, an inspiring local nonprofit dedicated to educating youth a
 bout the dangers of substance abuse and fentanyl poisoning.\n\nOur 2025 Gr
 and Bazaar welcomed more than 3\,000 community members and raised over $20
 \,000 to support this life-saving mission. Join us this year for an even b
 igger\, better\, and more spacious event. Together\, we can make a meaning
 ful difference for our youth—and you may even learn how to save a life.
LOCATION:Petaluma Fairgrounds
URL:https://giving4life.org/2026-grand-bazaar/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
