SUMMARY:Joseph Phelps Vineyards Table Series: The Backus Table
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261004T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261004T113000
UID:260909d8GLjMIAG0WRSm2OXO2iPQ
DESCRIPTION:Join Joseph Phelps Vineyards for an intimate exploration of on
 e of Napa Valley’s most iconic Cabernet Sauvignon vineyards. Guests will
  experience Backus Vineyard firsthand with an exclusive visit to the stori
 ed site\, set on the volcanic slopes overlooking Oakville. The experience 
 continues at the Home Ranch with a tasting of exceptionally limited librar
 y vintages alongside the current release\, paired with a thoughtfully cura
 ted culinary experience designed to showcase the depth\, character and evo
 lution of these celebrated wines. Prepaid reservations for parties of 1 to
  4 are available on Sunday\, October 4th and Sunday\, October 11th for $52
 5 per person. Availability is limited.
LOCATION:Joseph Phelps Vineyards
URL:https://www.exploretock.com/josephphelps/experience/581605/table-serie
 s-the-backus-table?date=2026-10-04&size=2&time=10%3A00
