 om Crooked Goat Brewing\, and “Zelensky’s Orange Juice” from John Kr
 eidler a special friend of SWF. There will be plentiful Ukrainian snacks\,
  BBQ\, vegetarian options\, beer\, wine\, and other beverages\, Ukrainian 
 music\, and lots of fun. Proceeds support Sebastopol World Friends on-goin
 g efforts to fund renovation of a dormitory building in Chyhyryn\, Ukraine
  \\(Sebastopol’s sister city\\) that will house hundreds of Internally D
 isplaced People from areas of Ukraine who have been impacted by the war th
 ere. Tickets are $75 and are all inclusive. Tickets must be purchased in a
 dvance at https://www.tickettailor.com/events/sebastopolworldfriends/22868
