DESCRIPTION:Embrace the beauty of autumn and join us for a Fall Wreath-Mak
 ing workshop that will leave your front door adorned with seasonal splendo
 r! In this class you will learn how to create a lush and fragrant hol
 iday wreath using a wire frame and foliage\, branches\, and other dried 
 materials. Whether you're a novice or a seasoned crafter\, this workshop o
 ffers a warm and welcoming environment for all skill levels.\n\nSilvia Bag
 nacani \\(the teacher\\) is a professional artist\, educator\, and floral 
 designer with a passion for celebrating the beauty of seasonal blooms. Kno
 wn around Sonoma for her inspiring floral arranging and wreath-making work
 shops\, Silvia thoughtfully sources local flowers and foliage to create st
 unning\, nature-inspired designs. \n\nAge: Teen - Adult
