SUMMARY:Handbuilding 101 with Deborah Donahower
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261005T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261005T123000
UID:260815mXvwZYQeWUuQhf1CsVJYnw
DESCRIPTION:Every Monday · 8 weeks\n\nDate & Time\n\nAugust 10 – Octobe
 r 5\, 2026\n\n9:30 AM – 12:30 PM\n\nExceptions\n\nSeptember 7 – Labor 
 Day\n\nLocation\n\nRoom 117\, Ceramics Studio\n\nCategory\n\nCeramics\, Ex
 tended Classes\n\nExperience Level\n\nAll Levels\n\nAges\n\n17\\+\n\nRegis
 tration Cost:\n\n$265\n\nMaterials Fee:\n\n$30\n\nTotal Registration Cost:
 \n\n$295\n\nLearn the fundamentals of creating handbuilt\, functional obje
 cts with clay in this 8 week course. Thoughtfully explore the tried and tr
 ue techniques of ceramic work!\n\nprogram overview\n\nDeborah Donahower ta
 kes you through the fundamentals of working with clay in hand building in 
 this 8 week course. Designed for all levels \\(beginners and those more ex
 perienced\\) Deborah thoughtfully explores the tried and true techniques o
 f ceramic work with her students through structured assignments\, allowing
  her students to develop their own creative voice in the process. This cou
 rse will emphasize building functional forms with creative surface design 
 in mind\; focusing on forms with large areas to explore texture\, painterl
 y surface techniques\, and much more. Students will receive instruction in
  hand building\, and basic glazing techniques. With your 8 week class regi
 stration\, students receive the opportunity to purchase a studio pass for 
 ½ off during the duration of their class. Sign ups for membership will be
  included in your pre class email
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center
URL:https://sonomacommunitycenter.org/programs/handbuilding-101-august/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
