CATEGORIES:Music
DESCRIPTION:SRJC Symphonic Band\, Jazz Band\, and the Santa Rosa High Scho
 ol Band invite audiences on a musical journey through stars\, legends\, an
 d fantasy.  The SRJC Symphonic Band explores the magic and mystery of the 
 imagination through music including The Sorcerer's Apprentice\, famously f
 eatured in Disney's Fantasia\; Starry Ocean\, inspired by the vastness and
  wonder of the night sky\; and the night-evoking Incantation and Dance.  T
 he SRJC Jazz Band brings its own take on fantasy and imagination with Gate
 s of Tashbaan from The Chronicles of Narnia\, the jazz classic Stella by S
 tarlight\, and Pure Imagination from Willy Wonka.  Guest ensemble Santa Ro
 sa High School Symphonic Band joins the performance\, culminating in a spe
 cial joint-ensemble finale with SRJC.  &#160\;For more information and tic
 kets\, visit the SRJC Music Events website. (https://music.santarosa.edu/e
 vents)&#160\;
LAST-MODIFIED:20260908T202405Z
LOCATION:Burbank Auditorium - Santa Rosa Campus
URL:https://calendar.santarosa.edu/event/23980-stars-legends-fantasy-symph
 onic-band-amp
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  SRJC Symphonic Band\, Jazz Band\, and th
 e Santa Rosa High School Band invite audiences on a musical journey throug
 h stars\, legends\, and fantasy.</p><p>  The SRJC Symphonic Band explores 
 the magic and mystery of the imagination through music including <strong>T
 he Sorcerer's Apprentice</strong>\, famously featured in Disney's <em>Fant
 asia</em>\; <strong>Starry Ocean</strong>\, inspired by the vastness and w
 onder of the night sky\; and the night-evoking <strong>Incantation and Dan
 ce</strong>.</p><p>  The SRJC Jazz Band brings its own take on fantasy and
  imagination with <strong>Gates of Tashbaan</strong> from <em>The Chronicl
 es of Narnia</em>\, the jazz classic <strong>Stella by Starlight</strong>\
 , and <strong>Pure Imagination</strong> from <em>Willy Wonka</em>.</p><p> 
  Guest ensemble <strong>Santa Rosa High School Symphonic Band</strong> joi
 ns the performance\, culminating in a special joint-ensemble finale with S
 RJC.</p><p>  &#160\;</p><p><a href="https://music.santarosa.edu/events" ta
 rget="_blank" rel="noopener">For more information and tickets\, visit the 
 SRJC Music Events website.</a>&#160\;</p>
