BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.bandsintown.com/e/108584685?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=287&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Jordan Loder
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261008T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261008T000000
UID:260813x1WwvUz7ZE-vkOcDFBYuDA
DESCRIPTION:Jordan's concerts and retreats have graced stages worldwide\, 
 from festivals to yoga studios\, fostering community through call-and-resp
 onse chanting rooted in timeless bhakti traditions—expressed in a contem
 porary way that is all his own.  \n\nHis approach is refreshing in its dep
 th and sincerity: profound without pretense\, free of spiritual titles or 
 proclaimed powers\, carried instead with quiet humility\, gentle humor\, a
 nd an effortless lightness of being. Everything is sacred\, with no except
 ions—his gatherings offer spaces for emotional release\, deep laughter\,
  and profound stillness\, inviting all to rest in the ever-present Self.\n
 \nJordan Loder is an international kirtan artist whose devotional chanting
  flows from raw vulnerability and heartfelt presence. Influenced deeply by
  Ramana Maharshi's teachings—first felt in youth and later deepened thro
 ugh pilgrimage and extended residence near Arunachala—Jordan weaves anci
 ent Hindu and Buddhist mantras centered on forgiveness\, gratitude\, and c
 ompassion.\n\nHe draws from extensive immersion in the global kirtan commu
 nity having toured in a supportive role with beloved artists like Snatam K
 aur\, Deva Premal & Miten\, GuruGanesha\, Simrit\, Ajeet\, The Landis Brot
 hers\, Hans Christian\, Stephen Bross\, Matt Pszonak\, and Adam Bauer.\n\n
 www.JordanLoder.com
LOCATION:Glen Ellen Gathering Space
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/108584685?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
