DESCRIPTION:Lily Tomlin\, the legendary comedian\, actress\, writer\, and 
 cultural icon whose career spans over five decades\, is returning to the L
 BC stage on October 8 with the Lily Tomlin Tour 2026. The performance is n
 ot just stand-up\; it is a masterclass in storytelling and observation\, o
 ffering a powerful evening of intelligence\, satire\, character-driven com
 edy\, and sharp social commentary. Known for her groundbreaking humor\, un
 forgettable characters\, and fearless perspective\, Lily delivers comedy t
 hat is thoughtful\, hilarious\, and deeply human. LBC members at the Contr
 ibutor level and above beat the lines with VIP access to this show's Club 
 reception
