DESCRIPTION:For 50 years\, the Sonoma County Harvest Fair has highlighted 
 Sonoma County’s incredible agriculture\, wineries\, artisan makers and c
 ulinary stars. Since the Fair’s inception in 1975\, it has gained a repu
 tation as one of the premiere regional wine judgings in the country. It dr
 aws a considerable amount of attention and interest on both a statewide an
 d national level. The Harvest Fair recruits 18 judges representing trade\,
  education\, writers\, retailers and others in the wine and hospitality in
 dustr
