DESCRIPTION:Raise a glass for a great cause at Healdsburg Crush\, moving t
 o a new iconic location\, Bacchus Landing\, on Sunday\, October 11\, 2026.
  Enjoy a rare chance to sip world-class wines all in one place at one of S
 onoma County’s most beloved gathering spots. Sample Pinot Noir\, Chardon
 nay\, and Sparkling Wines from 60+ of California’s top producers\, all i
 n an open-air\, walk-around format that celebrates the best of wine countr
 y. Enjoy VIP early access from 12–1pm\, followed by General Admission fr
 om 1–4pm. 
