BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Occidental Center for the Arts": "https://www.occidentalcenterforthearts.org/upcoming-events/david-luning-friends"}
X-SOURCE-ID:occidental_arts
SUMMARY:John Prine Tribute with David Luning\, Jason Crosby\, Ben Dubin an
 d Victoria George
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261011T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261011T200000
UID:6a137d11fdf9506a76bad2f3@squarespace.com
DESCRIPTION:David Luning returns to OCA for a special tribute celebrating 
 John Prine's birthday. David will be joined by musical colleagues Jason Cr
 osby\, Ben Dubin and Victoria George.\nTickets are $35\, $30 for OCA membe
 rs.\nGet Tickets\nThis show will take place in our auditorium. Doors open 
 at 5:30 PM.\nDavid Luning knew at a young age the path his life should tak
 e. Throughout generations\, troubadours and singers have harnessed the cul
 tural landscape and passed it along\, with the likes of John Prine and Tow
 nes Van Zandt paving the way with the telling of their stories. Following 
 in those footsteps\, the 29-year-old Sonoma County singer/songwriter's new
  record is the product of a massive turn in his life and taps into that cu
 ltural archive. Listening to ‘Souvenirs’ by John Prine\, was a corners
 tone moment\, compelling Luning to leave Berklee College and follow in the
  tradition of these iconic troubadours.
LOCATION:Occidental Center for the Arts\, 3850 Doris Murphy Court\, Occide
 ntal
URL:https://www.occidentalcenterforthearts.org/upcoming-events/david-lunin
 g-friends
X-SOURCE:Occidental Center for the Arts
END:VEVENT
