DESCRIPTION:checklistMore DetailscommentDescriptionmanage_accountsInstruct
 or InfoinfoFAQprogram overviewThis workshop is specifically designed for c
 omplete beginners who want to explore Raku ceramics. It serves as a founda
 tional step for anyone intending to register for Azelia’s subsequent Rak
 u Firing course.This introductory class is focused on preparation and theo
