 of Sonoma Mountain? Join geologist Nicole Myers for Rocktober at Jack Lond
 on State Historic Park and explore the fascinating geologic forces that ha
 ve shaped Sonoma Mountain. As part of the Triple Watershed Series presente
 d by Sonoma State University’s Center for Environmental Inquiry\, this p
 rogram will focus on the Sonoma Creek watershed and reveal how rocks\, wat
 er\, and life are all connected. The program will begin at the museum\, fo
LOCATION:Jack London State Historic Park\, 2400 London Ranch Road\, Glen E
 llen\, CA 95442
