 miles of varied terrain. All levels and ages welcome. Tickets are $20. Ple
 ase wear weather-appropriate clothing to feel comfortable being in a natur
 al setting and bring water (as needed). Meet outside the Visitor Center u
LOCATION:Sugarloaf Ridge State Park\, 2605 Adobe Canyon Road\, Kenwood\, C
 A 95452
