DESCRIPTION:Each year\, LumaFest brings community members together for our
  educational open house and Día de los Muertos celebration\, giving guest
 s an opportunity to experience the energy and diversity of our community\,
  explore college and career pathways\, and to connect with SRJC programs a
 nd local community organizations.  From colorful performances and hands-on
  art activities to live music\, and local food favorites\, there's somethi
 ng for everyone at SRJC Petaluma's biggest event of the year.  Whether you
 're visiting with family\, friends\, or flying solo\, you'll find inspirat
 ion around every corner.For more information\, visit the SRJC LumaFest web
 site. (https://lumafest.santarosa.edu/)  &#160\;SRJC Petaluma - 680 Sonoma
  Mountain Pkwy\, Petaluma\, CA 94954
