 me: 1:00PM-4:00PM\nLocation: Santa Rosa Store\nFee: $45.00\n\n\nIn my ong
 oing Gel-Printing & Collage workshop I want to offer you the opportunity 
 to collage with your handmade papers\, starting with an easy project prog
 ressing each class to a more challenging one.\n\nI will demonstrate techn
 iques for making papers with and without the Gel-Plate. We will create a 
