 4fa3769ae5/652aed378bbc014a065e4371/scaled_1024.jpg
X-TKF-CUSTOM-PREVIEW:Instructor: Anne Millett Date: This is a 6-class ser
 ies\, meeting 6 Tuesdays September 15th\, 22nd\, 29th\, October 6th\, 13t
 h & 20th. Time: 10:30AM-1:00PM...
LOCATION:Rileystreet Art Supply\,103 Maxwell Ct\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95401\,
