 r the outdoor canopy\, between buildings 400 &amp\; 500.</p><p>  For faste
 r check-in\, download the "MySRJC App" and register with Redwood Empire Fo
 od Bank prior to the event.</p><p>  Don't forget to bring your own grocery
  bags\, some bags will be provided on a first come first serve basis.</p><
 p>  Can't make it? Leftover produce and other items are moved to the Welco
 me &amp\; Connect Center Food Pantry after each event and will stay there 
