SUMMARY: Take the art of Still Life to new places
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Sandra Novia\n\nDates: Fridays\, Ongoing. This is
  an ongoing 6-class series\, meeting 6 consecutive Fridays. You can start
  your series anytime.\n\nTime: 2:30pm - 4:30pm.\n\nLocation : Santa Rosa 
 Store\n\nFee: $310 for 6 classes. Please check with instructor for detail
 s.\n\n\n\nThis class is for art explorers of all levels!\n\nCreating a st
 ill life is about waking up your observational skills. Moving through dif
 ferent mediums\, we will embark on a journey together\, exploring how to 
 apply many art forms and techniques to express what you see in life.\n\nI
 n this six week course\, each class will explore a different art medium. 
 We will draw and paint with graphite\, watercolor pencils and acrylic. We
  will expand on those mediums as we move into printmaking\, collage\, and
  mosaic to bring your art to life. It's a great class to learn the fundam
 entals for beginners and for experienced artists that want to try their h
 and at a new art form you haven't done before.\n\nAll levels Welcomed.\n\
 nLet's explore the beautiful art of expressing Art together.\n\n\nTo regi
 ster for this series\, please contact Sandra Novia at: (707) 433-ARTS (27
 87)\n\n
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa,Mixed-Media
