SUMMARY:In the Spotlight: Lawrence's George "Nash" Walker
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261110
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261111
DTSTAMP:20260811T154416Z
UID:20261110T080000Z-23088@calendar.santarosa.edu
