 s the kingdom is plunged into eternal winter\, Elsa flees\, and Anna embar
 ks on a journey with Kristoff\, Sven\, and Olaf to find her sister and hea
 l the kingdom.</p><p><strong>Ticketing:</strong><a href="https://srjc.univ
 ersitytickets.com/w/event.aspx?id=1822" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Vis
 it SRJC's Theatre Arts tickets page for details and tickets.</a></p>
