DESCRIPTION:Learn how to recognize and respond to an opioid overdose and h
 ow to use Narcan® (naloxone) to potentially save a life. This workshop al
 so introduces harm reduction strategies that can help reduce the risks ass
 ociated with substance use and promote safety and well-being.To register v
 isit the Student Health Services website. (https://shs.santarosa.edu/11-18
 -26-narcan)
