  opioid overdose and how to use Narcan® (naloxone) to potentially save a 
 life. This workshop also introduces harm reduction strategies that can hel
 p reduce the risks associated with substance use and promote safety and we
 ll-being.</p><p><a href="https://shs.santarosa.edu/11-18-26-narcan" target
 ="_blank" rel="noopener">To register visit the Student Health Services web
