SUMMARY: Pastel Basics: Materials and Technique
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Suzanne Carson\n\nWednesdays\, Ongoing\n1:00PM - 
 3:00PM\nLocation: Santa Rosa Store\n\n$30.00 per session\n\n\nUnlock your
  creativity in this soft pastel class\, where you’ll learn to create stun
 ning\, textured artwork from start to finish! Whether you're a beginner o
 r looking to refine your skills\, this class covers everything you need t
 o know. You'll get informed instruction on how to begin a piece\, from ch
 oosing the right materials to selecting the perfect color palette. We’ll 
 dive into composition techniques to help you craft a balanced\, captivati
 ng piece\, and walk you through the finishing touches that bring your wor
 k to life. By the end of the class\, you’ll have the tools and confidence
  to complete your own soft pastel masterpiece!\n\nTo Register for this cl
 ass\, please call or text Suzanne at 707-888-2083
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa,Pastels
