  Moves\,” and “Letter of the Day.” Your family will laugh\, learn\, 
 and play together in a heartwarming celebration that you’ll treasure lon
 g after the final song. POST-SHOW MEET AND GREET Meet the Characters of EL
 MO’S GOT THE MOVES I
