SUMMARY: Fresh Pressed Flower Card Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Jan Lochner\nDate: Saturday\, December 19th\nTime
 : 2:00PM-5:00PM\nLocation: Santa Rosa Location\nFree: $40.00\n\nThis is a
  hands-on make and take class where you will make at least five items inc
 luding a bookmark\, a greeting card\, a fridge magnet and an ornament. Th
 e class will use two different techniques and Jan will explain how to pre
 ss flowers and which flowers hold their color best. It is a creative expe
 rience!\n\n\nTo register for this workshop\, please contact Jan at: mailt
 o:freshpressedflowercards@yahoo.com freshpressedflowercards@yahoo.com mai
 lto:freshpressedflowercards@yahoo.com\n\nCreating note cards from pressed
  flowers has been Jan’s hobby for 25 years\, though she has no formal art
  training. She utilizes color\,\nshape and texture on fine quality paper\
 , each card uniquely handmade. Jan’s home in Sebastopol is her studio: th
 e dining room table is her workshop\, the kitchen cupboards storing boxes
  and trays of flowers. She buys card stock by the thousand and picks bloo
 ms from her garden and other public places. Her family is used to me sayi
 ng\, “could we stop for just a few minutes so I can gather some… ”\n\nIt 
 is a wonderful way of life.\n\n*A note to all students: Please park on in
  the East facing parking lot while attending classes. We greatly apprecia
 te it. Thank you.
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa
